<!doctype lake><title>Gated DeltaNet</title><meta name="reading-minutes" content="58"><section class="lake-revised-section">
<h1 id="gdn-与-token-mixer">GDN 与 Token Mixer</h1>
<ul>
<li>标准因果注意力先构造 token 两两之间的相似度，再经过 softmax 归一化。以下采用不含 softmax 的点积形式表示线性注意力，其历史键值对可累积到固定大小的状态矩阵。设 Q/K/V 按 token 排成行，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-165%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22M_%7Bij%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%201_%7Bj%5C%5Cle%20i%7D%22%7D"></card> 为二值因果掩码，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-166%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20M_%7Bij%7D%22%7D"></card> 在可见位置为 0、不可见位置为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-167%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cinfty%22%7D"></card>，两种输出分别为</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="O_{\mathrm{attn}}=\operatorname{softmax}(sQK^\top+\mathcal M)V,
\qquad O_{\mathrm{linear}}=s(QK^\top\odot M)V,
\qquad s=d_k^{-1/2}.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-168%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22O_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Battn%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsoftmax%7D(sQK%5E%5C%5Ctop%2B%5C%5Cmathcal%20M)V%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20O_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blinear%7D%7D%3Ds(QK%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%20M)V%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20s%3Dd_k%5E%7B-1%2F2%7D.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>上述并行表达式包含序列长度平方数量的成对权重。FlashAttention 可通过分块与融合避免完整权重矩阵的显存往返，但成对计算量仍随序列长度平方增长。线性注意力的优势来自其等价递推：每个 head 维护 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-169%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d_v%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%22%7D"></card> 的状态，单步更新与读出均为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-170%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22O(d_kd_v)%22%7D"></card>。因果掩码不能直接移到矩阵乘法外，训练时可通过 chunkwise 分解，将块内计算组织为矩阵乘法，将块间依赖压缩到状态传递</li>
<li>状态矩阵构成从 key 到 value 的线性关联记忆。外积叠加时，非正交 key 之间的交叉内积会耦合不同关联，形成检索干扰。GDN 以 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-171%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_tS_%7Bt-1%7D%22%7D"></card> 为衰减后的参考状态，以 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-172%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22v_t-%5C%5Calpha_tS_%7Bt-1%7Dk_t%22%7D"></card> 为当前键值对的预测残差，沿 key 方向执行秩一校正。其中，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-173%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%7D"></card> 调节历史状态的整体保留比例，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-174%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%7D"></card> 调节残差校正的步长，二者共同决定状态的遗忘与写入。输出门对状态读出结果进行逐通道调制，不参与状态递推</li>
</ul>
<figure class="lake-figure" style="width: 640px;">
  <img src="assets/15cc70833f0cd60b35726b49d8f778f8.png" alt="Gated DeltaNet 模型结构与 token mixer" width="2058" height="1122">
</figure>
<ul>
<li>Token mixer 的 Q/K/V 分支依次经过线性投影、逐通道短因果卷积和 SiLU，Q/K 再沿每个 head 的特征维做 L2 归一化。短卷积提供局部时序特征，Gated Delta Rule 维护跨 token 的矩阵状态；两者在解码时分别保留卷积窗口与 recurrent state</li>
<li>衰减门与写入系数由独立投影生成，不经过 Q/K/V 的短卷积。状态输出先按 head 归一化，再与输出门逐元素相乘，最后投影回隐藏维度</li>
</ul>
</section><section class="lake-revised-section">
<h1 id="前置知识线性注意力与-deltanet">前置知识：线性注意力与 DeltaNet</h1>
<h2 id="线性注意力与-mamba2">线性注意力与 Mamba2</h2>
<ul>
<li>对单个注意力头，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-175%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20q_t%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%20R%5E%7Bd_k%7D%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-176%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%20R%5E%7Bd_v%7D%22%7D"></card> 均为列向量，状态 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-177%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%20R%5E%7Bd_v%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%22%7D"></card>。下述论文推导取输出缩放 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-178%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s%3D1%22%7D"></card>，实现部分保留 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-179%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s%3Dd_k%5E%7B-1%2F2%7D%22%7D"></card>。论文 §2.1 的线性注意力通过外积累积键值关联，通过矩阵向量乘法读取状态</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf S_t=\mathbf S_{t-1}+\boldsymbol v_t\boldsymbol k_t^\top,
\qquad \boldsymbol o_t=\mathbf S_t\boldsymbol q_t.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-180%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_t%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7Bt-1%7D%2B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20o_t%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20q_t.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>在零初态下，将状态展开并代入输出，得到矩阵并行形式。<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-181%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20V%22%7D"></card> 按 token 排成行，M 为包含对角线的二值因果掩码</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\boldsymbol o_t=\sum_{j=1}^{t}
(\boldsymbol q_t^\top\boldsymbol k_j)\boldsymbol v_j,
\qquad
\mathbf O=(\mathbf Q\mathbf K^\top\odot\mathbf M)\mathbf V.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-182%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20o_t%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%5Cn(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20q_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_j)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_j%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20O%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%20M)%5C%5Cmathbf%20V.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>Mamba2 的标量衰减形式在状态更新中引入数据相关的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-183%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%7D"></card>。令 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-184%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_t%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%5C%5Calpha_i%22%7D"></card>，位置 j 的写入传播到位置 t 时保留 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-185%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_t%2F%5C%5Cgamma_j%22%7D"></card>，并行形式中的因果掩码相应变为带衰减的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-186%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CGamma%22%7D"></card></li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
\mathbf S_t&amp;=\alpha_t\mathbf S_{t-1}+\boldsymbol v_t\boldsymbol k_t^\top,
&amp;\boldsymbol o_t&amp;=\mathbf S_t\boldsymbol q_t,\\
\mathbf O&amp;=(\mathbf Q\mathbf K^\top\odot\Gamma)\mathbf V,
&amp;\Gamma_{ij}&amp;=\begin{cases}\gamma_i/\gamma_j,&amp;i\ge j,\\0,&amp;i&lt;j.\end{cases}
\end{aligned}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-187%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_t%26%3D%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7Bt-1%7D%2B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%2C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20o_t%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20q_t%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20O%26%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%5C%5CGamma)%5C%5Cmathbf%20V%2C%5Cn%26%5C%5CGamma_%7Bij%7D%26%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Cgamma_i%2F%5C%5Cgamma_j%2C%26i%5C%5Cge%20j%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C0%2C%26i%3Cj.%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>分块训练将序列划分为长度 C 的 chunk，块内累计衰减为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-188%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5C%5Calpha_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%22%7D"></card>，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-189%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E0%3D1%22%7D"></card>。入口状态向块内位置 r 传播时乘 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-190%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card>，当前位置的写入传播到块末时乘 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-191%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5EC%2F%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card>。将这些系数分别吸收到 Q、K 和入口状态中，得到论文 Eq. (2) 的分块形式</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
\mathbf S_{[t+1]}&amp;=\overrightarrow{\mathbf S}_{[t]}
+\mathbf V_{[t]}^\top\overrightarrow{\mathbf K}_{[t]},\\
\mathbf O_{[t]}&amp;=\overleftarrow{\mathbf Q}_{[t]}\mathbf S_{[t]}^\top
+(\mathbf Q_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}^\top\odot\Gamma_{[t]})\mathbf V_{[t]}.
\end{aligned}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-192%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%2B1%5D%7D%26%3D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20S%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20O_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%26%3D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5Cn%2B(%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>这里 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-193%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20q%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card>，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-194%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D(%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5EC%2F%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card>，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-195%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20S%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5EC%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card>。状态在 chunk 之间递推，块内输出通过矩阵乘法并行计算</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="deltanet-与-gated-delta-rule">DeltaNet 与 Gated Delta Rule</h2>
<ul>
<li>标量门对整个状态统一衰减。DeltaNet 则先由 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-196%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%22%7D"></card> 读取当前 key 对应的旧 value，再以 beta 控制旧值擦除和新值写入。对应论文 §2.2 的更新为</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
\mathbf S_t&amp;=\mathbf S_{t-1}
-\beta_t(\mathbf S_{t-1}\boldsymbol k_t)\boldsymbol k_t^\top
+\beta_t\boldsymbol v_t\boldsymbol k_t^\top\\
&amp;=\mathbf S_{t-1}(\mathbf I-\beta_t\boldsymbol k_t\boldsymbol k_t^\top)
+\beta_t\boldsymbol v_t\boldsymbol k_t^\top.
\end{aligned}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-197%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_t%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn-%5C%5Cbeta_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%5Cn%2B%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7Bt-1%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%5E%5C%5Ctop)%5Cn%2B%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%5E%5C%5Ctop.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-198%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card> 是广义 Householder 转移矩阵；单位 key 且 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-199%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%3D2%22%7D"></card> 时为标准 Householder 反射。当前 sigmoid 写入门取 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-200%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%7D"></card>，控制沿 key 方向的部分擦除；正交方向不受这项更新影响。连续转移矩阵的乘积可用 WY 表示组织为块矩阵计算</li>
<li>Gated DeltaNet 将全局衰减与 Delta 更新结合，对应论文 Eq. (10)：先衰减入口状态，再按当前键值关联完成残差写入</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
\mathbf S_t&amp;=\mathbf S_{t-1}
\left[\alpha_t(\mathbf I-\beta_t\boldsymbol k_t\boldsymbol k_t^\top)\right]
+\beta_t\boldsymbol v_t\boldsymbol k_t^\top,\\
\boldsymbol o_t&amp;=\mathbf S_t\boldsymbol q_t.
\end{aligned}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-201%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_t%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Calpha_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%5E%5C%5Ctop)%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%2B%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20o_t%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20q_t.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-202%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%7D"></card> 控制历史状态的整体衰减，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-203%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%7D"></card> 控制当前 key 方向的更新强度。令 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-204%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%3D1%22%7D"></card> 即退化为 DeltaNet；单位 key 且 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-205%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%3D1%22%7D"></card> 时，该方向上的旧 value 被新 value 替换</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="在线学习与-ttt-视角">在线学习与 TTT 视角</h2>
<ul>
<li>论文 Table 1 将 GDN 更新表示为在线目标的闭式解。该目标的参考状态为衰减后的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-206%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7Bt-1%7D%22%7D"></card>，关联项使用当前键值对相对于该参考状态的残差</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf S_t=\underset{\mathbf S}{\arg\min}\left[\|\mathbf S-\alpha_t\mathbf S_{t-1}\|_F^2-2\left\langle\mathbf S\boldsymbol k_t,\beta_t(\boldsymbol v_t-\alpha_t\mathbf S_{t-1}\boldsymbol k_t)\right\rangle\right].
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-207%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_t%3D%5C%5Cunderset%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20S%7D%7B%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%20S-%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5C%7C_F%5E2-2%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clangle%5C%5Cmathbf%20S%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%2C%5C%5Cbeta_t(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_t-%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t)%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crangle%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>从 TTT（Test-Time Training）视角，状态矩阵作为在线回归模型的参数。DeltaNet 对平方回归损失执行一步梯度下降，beta 对应更新步长</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathcal L(\mathbf S)=\tfrac12\|\mathbf S\boldsymbol k_t-\boldsymbol v_t\|_2^2,\qquad \mathbf S_t=\mathbf S_{t-1}-\beta_t\nabla\mathcal L(\mathbf S_{t-1})=\mathbf S_{t-1}-\beta_t(\mathbf S_{t-1}\boldsymbol k_t-\boldsymbol v_t)\boldsymbol k_t^\top.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-208%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20L(%5C%5Cmathbf%20S)%3D%5C%5Ctfrac12%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%20S%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t-%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_t%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_t%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7Bt-1%7D-%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cnabla%5C%5Cmathcal%20L(%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7Bt-1%7D)%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7Bt-1%7D-%5C%5Cbeta_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t-%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_t%5E%5C%5Ctop.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>GDN 在梯度更新前加入自适应权重衰减 alpha</li>
</ul>
</section><section class="lake-revised-section">
<h1 id="chunk-的矩阵表示">Chunk 的矩阵表示</h1>
<figure class="lake-figure">
  <img src="assets/9691797e3fc0fd9c777baae08fcbb524.png" alt="顺序计算与分离状态递推后的 Chunk 并行计算示意图" width="1260" height="370" loading="lazy">
</figure>
<h2 id="deltanet-的-wy-表示与-ut-变换">DeltaNet 的 WY 表示与 UT 变换</h2>
<ul>
<li>将序列划分为长度 C 的块，块内 Q/K/V 按 token 排成行。<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-209%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card> 为第 t 块的入口状态，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-210%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card> 为处理块内前 r 个 token 后的状态。不含衰减的 DeltaNet 在块内累积广义 Householder 转移矩阵；WY 表示将这一连乘写成单位矩阵减去低秩项，对应论文 Eq. (4)</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf P_{[t]}^r
=\prod_{i=1}^{r}\left(\mathbf I-\beta_{[t]}^i\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^{i\top}\right)
=\mathbf I-\sum_{i=1}^{r}\boldsymbol w_{[t]}^i\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^{i\top}.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-211%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20P_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>乘积按 token 顺序从左向右排列。WY 系数按以下递推生成，对应论文 Eq. (4)。每个新 key 的写入系数需要扣除此前 key 内积带来的贡献</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\boldsymbol w_{[t]}^r=\beta_{[t]}^r\left(
\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r-\sum_{i&lt;r}\boldsymbol w_{[t]}^i
(\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^{i\top}\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r)\right).
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-212%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er-%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3Cr%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5Cn(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er)%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>新增状态同样可以写成 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-213%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5Er%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20u_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card>，U 的递推将右端的当前 key 换成 value；两者共享此前 key 内积形成的下三角系数</li>
<li>UT 变换将上述逐位置递推写为同一个下三角系统，对应论文 Eq. (6)–(7)</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
\mathbf T_{[t]}&amp;=
\left[\mathbf I+\operatorname{strictLower}\!\left(
\operatorname{diag}(\beta_{[t]})\mathbf K_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}^\top
\right)\right]^{-1}\operatorname{diag}(\beta_{[t]}),\\
\mathbf W_{[t]}&amp;=\mathbf T_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]},\qquad
\mathbf U_{[t]}=\mathbf T_{[t]}\mathbf V_{[t]}.
\end{aligned}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-214%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20T_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%26%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BstrictLower%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20W_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20T_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20U_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20T_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>WY 表示把转移矩阵的连乘改写为低秩更新的累加；UT 变换进一步将 W/U 的计算组织成三角求解与矩阵乘法。求解内部的因果依赖仍然存在，通过 16×16 局部前代与块间合并完成计算</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="gated-deltanet-的衰减与扩展-wy-表示">Gated DeltaNet 的衰减与扩展 WY 表示</h2>
<ul>
<li>在每个 chunk 内定义累计衰减 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-215%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5Er%5C%5Calpha_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%22%7D"></card>。将 Gated Delta Rule 展开，块内状态由入口状态的传播与当前块的新增状态组成</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
\mathbf S_{[t]}^r&amp;=\mathbf S_{[t]}\mathbf F_{[t]}^r+\mathbf G_{[t]}^r,\\
\mathbf F_{[t]}^r&amp;=\prod_{i=1}^{r}\alpha_{[t]}^i
\left(\mathbf I-\beta_{[t]}^i\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^{i\top}\right)
=\gamma_{[t]}^r\mathbf P_{[t]}^r.
\end{aligned}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-216%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20F_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20G_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20F_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%26%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5C%5Calpha_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cmathbf%20P_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>扩展的 WY 表示将每次新增写入传播到位置 r 的衰减显式保留。<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-217%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20u%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card> 扣除此前写入在当前 key 上的预测，再乘当前位置的写入系数</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
\mathbf G_{[t]}^r&amp;=\sum_{i=1}^{r}
\frac{\gamma_{[t]}^r}{\gamma_{[t]}^i}
\widetilde{\boldsymbol u}_{[t]}^i\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^{i\top},\\
\widetilde{\boldsymbol u}_{[t]}^r
&amp;=\beta_{[t]}^r\left(\boldsymbol v_{[t]}^r-
\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\widetilde{\boldsymbol u}_{[t]}^i
\left(\frac{\gamma_{[t]}^r}{\gamma_{[t]}^i}
\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^{i\top}\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r\right)\right).
\end{aligned}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-218%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20G_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%26%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20u%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20u%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er-%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20u%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>令 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-219%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)_%7Bij%7D%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%2F%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%22%7D"></card>（<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-220%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%5C%5Cge%20j%22%7D"></card>），上三角为零。按行堆叠后，得到论文 §3.3 的 UT 形式</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\widetilde{\mathbf U}_{[t]}=
\left[\mathbf I+\operatorname{strictLower}\!\left(
\operatorname{diag}(\beta_{[t]})
\left(\Gamma_{[t]}\odot\mathbf K_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}^\top\right)
\right)\right]^{-1}
\operatorname{diag}(\beta_{[t]})\mathbf V_{[t]}.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-221%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BstrictLower%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5E%7B-1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>与 DeltaNet 相比，三角系统中的 Gram 矩阵由 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-222%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card> 改为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-223%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card></li>
</ul>
<h2 id="块间状态与块内输出">块间状态与块内输出</h2>
<ul>
<li>沿用论文的箭头记号，将入口到当前位置、当前位置到块末的衰减分别写为</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
\overleftarrow{\boldsymbol q}_{[t]}^r&amp;=\gamma_{[t]}^r\boldsymbol q_{[t]}^r,
&amp;\overleftarrow{\boldsymbol w}_{[t]}^r&amp;=\gamma_{[t]}^r\boldsymbol w_{[t]}^r,\\
\overrightarrow{\boldsymbol k}_{[t]}^r&amp;=
\frac{\gamma_{[t]}^C}{\gamma_{[t]}^r}\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r,
&amp;\overrightarrow{\mathbf S}_{[t]}&amp;=\gamma_{[t]}^C\mathbf S_{[t]}.
\end{aligned}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-224%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20q%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%26%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%2C%5Cn%26%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20w%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%26%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%26%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5EC%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%2C%5Cn%26%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20S%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%26%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5EC%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>其中 W 为无衰减 DeltaNet 的 WY 系数。块间状态更新先将入口状态衰减至块末，再累积当前块的残差写入；论文原式为</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf S_{[t+1]}=\overrightarrow{\mathbf S}_{[t]}+
\left(\widetilde{\mathbf U}_{[t]}-
\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}_{[t]}\mathbf S_{[t]}^\top\right)^\top
\overrightarrow{\mathbf K}_{[t]}.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-225%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%2B1%5D%7D%3D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20S%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D-%5Cn%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright)%5E%5C%5Ctop%5Cn%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>块内输出由历史读出与当前块内的残差贡献相加。将论文 §3.3 输出式中的区间衰减显式写出，得到</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf O_{[t]}=\overleftarrow{\mathbf Q}_{[t]}\mathbf S_{[t]}^\top+
\left(\mathbf Q_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}^\top\odot\Gamma_{[t]}\right)
\left(\widetilde{\mathbf U}_{[t]}-
\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}_{[t]}\mathbf S_{[t]}^\top\right).
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-226%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20O_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D-%5Cn%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>这里必须使用带衰减的因果掩码 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-227%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card>，其可见位置取 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-228%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%2F%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%22%7D"></card>。论文原式在此使用 M 记号；若只把它解释为二值因果掩码，就会漏掉写入从位置 j 传播到 query 位置 i 的衰减。FLA 的输出 kernel 显式计算这个比例</li>
<li>W/U 可以按 chunk 并行生成；状态更新按 chunk 顺序推进；各块入口状态得到后，输出再次按 chunk 并行。块内残差 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-229%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D-%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card> 在状态更新与输出计算之间复用</li>
</ul>
<figure class="lake-figure">
  <img src="assets/5a911334822c698ec3df6a2fedbd320a.png" alt="Qwen3.5 Gated DeltaNet 计算流程：Q/K 经独立 L2 归一化，与 V、衰减门 alpha 和写入门 beta 进入状态算子，读出经 RMSNorm 和 SiLU 输出门后投影" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy">
</figure>
</section><section class="lake-revised-section">
<h1 id="模型调用方式qwen35-gateddeltanet">模型调用方式：Qwen3.5 GatedDeltaNet</h1>
<h2 id="输入投影">输入投影</h2>
<ul>
<li>设输入为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-230%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22X%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%20R%5E%7BT%5C%5Ctimes%20d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmodel%7D%7D%7D%22%7D"></card>。Q/K 的总投影维度为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-231%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d_Q%3DH_Kd_k%22%7D"></card>，V 的总投影维度为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-232%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d_V%3DH_Vd_v%22%7D"></card>。四个线性映射分别产生卷积输入、衰减参数、写入参数和输出门</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="P=XW_{qkv}^{\top},\qquad a=XW_a^{\top},\quad b=XW_b^{\top},\qquad Z=XW_z^{\top}.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-233%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22P%3DXW_%7Bqkv%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20a%3DXW_a%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%5C%5Cquad%20b%3DXW_b%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20Z%3DXW_z%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li><code>Qwen3_5MoeGatedDeltaNet</code> 将 Q/K/V 合并为一次投影，随后按通道拆分。衰减参数和写入参数只需要每个 value head 一个标量，因此 <code>in_proj_a</code>、<code>in_proj_b</code> 的输出维度为 <code>num_v_heads</code>；输出门需要逐通道调节读出结果，其投影维度与 V 相同</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-234%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20__init__(self%2C%20config%3A%20Qwen3_5MoeConfig%2C%20layer_idx%3A%20int)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20super().__init__()%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.hidden_size%20%3D%20config.hidden_size%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.num_v_heads%20%3D%20config.linear_num_value_heads%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.num_k_heads%20%3D%20config.linear_num_key_heads%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.head_k_dim%20%3D%20config.linear_key_head_dim%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.head_v_dim%20%3D%20config.linear_value_head_dim%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.key_dim%20%3D%20self.head_k_dim%20*%20self.num_k_heads%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.value_dim%20%3D%20self.head_v_dim%20*%20self.num_v_heads%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.conv_kernel_size%20%3D%20config.linear_conv_kernel_dim%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.layer_idx%20%3D%20layer_idx%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.activation%20%3D%20config.hidden_act%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.layer_norm_epsilon%20%3D%20config.rms_norm_eps%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.conv_dim%20%3D%20self.key_dim%20*%202%20%2B%20self.value_dim%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.conv1d%20%3D%20nn.Conv1d(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20in_channels%3Dself.conv_dim%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20out_channels%3Dself.conv_dim%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20bias%3DFalse%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20kernel_size%3Dself.conv_kernel_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20groups%3Dself.conv_dim%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20padding%3Dself.conv_kernel_size%20-%201%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.dt_bias%20%3D%20nn.Parameter(torch.ones(self.num_v_heads))%5Cn%20%20%20%20A%20%3D%20torch.empty(self.num_v_heads).uniform_(0.01%2C%2016)%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.A_log%20%3D%20nn.Parameter(torch.log(A))%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.norm%20%3D%20Qwen3_5MoeRMSNormGated(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.head_v_dim%2C%20eps%3Dself.layer_norm_epsilon%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.out_proj%20%3D%20nn.Linear(self.value_dim%2C%20self.hidden_size%2C%20bias%3DFalse)%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.layer_type%20%3D%20config.layer_types%5Blayer_idx%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.in_proj_qkv%20%3D%20nn.Linear(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.hidden_size%2C%20self.key_dim%20*%202%20%2B%20self.value_dim%2C%20bias%3DFalse%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.in_proj_z%20%3D%20nn.Linear(self.hidden_size%2C%20self.value_dim%2C%20bias%3DFalse)%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.in_proj_b%20%3D%20nn.Linear(self.hidden_size%2C%20self.num_v_heads%2C%20bias%3DFalse)%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.in_proj_a%20%3D%20nn.Linear(self.hidden_size%2C%20self.num_v_heads%2C%20bias%3DFalse)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%E6%8A%95%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%8E%E9%97%A8%E6%8E%A7%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22Transformers%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhuggingface%2Ftransformers%2Fblob%2Fv5.17.0%2Fsrc%2Ftransformers%2Fmodels%2Fqwen3_5_moe%2Fmodeling_qwen3_5_moe.py%23L507-L549%22%7D%7D"></card>
<h2 id="short-conv门控与-head-映射">Short Conv、门控与 Head 映射</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Short Conv 的计算。</strong> Q/K/V 的联合投影 P 先经过 depthwise causal convolution，再应用 SiLU。每个通道有独立的宽度 w 的卷积核，不进行通道间混合。按 PyTorch 的权重排列，第 c 个通道在位置 t 的输出为</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\operatorname{ShortConv}(P)_{t,c}
=\operatorname{SiLU}\!\left(\sum_{j=0}^{w-1}
\theta_{c,j}P_{t-w+1+j,c}\right).
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-235%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BShortConv%7D(P)_%7Bt%2Cc%7D%5Cn%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%3D0%7D%5E%7Bw-1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctheta_%7Bc%2Cj%7DP_%7Bt-w%2B1%2Bj%2Cc%7D%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>序列起点之前补零；w=4 时，输出依赖当前 token 与之前三个 token。代码使用 <code>groups=hidden_size</code> 实现逐通道卷积，<code>padding=w-1</code> 后截取前 <code>seq_len</code> 个位置，保证不使用未来输入。以下是 Transformers 中 <code>causal_conv1d_fn</code> 的实际 PyTorch 后备实现；对应加速算子可用时由 kernel dispatch 替换</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-236%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20causal_conv1d_fn(%5Cn%20%20%20%20hidden_states%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20weight%3A%20nn.Parameter%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20bias%3A%20nn.Parameter%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20activation%3A%20str%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20**kwargs%2C%5Cn)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20_%2C%20hidden_size%2C%20seq_len%20%3D%20hidden_states.shape%5Cn%20%20%20%20padding%20%3D%20weight.shape%5B-1%5D%20-%201%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20out%20%3D%20F.conv1d(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20hidden_states.to(weight.dtype)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20weight%3Dweight.unsqueeze(1)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20bias%3Dbias%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20padding%3Dpadding%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20groups%3Dhidden_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5B%3A%2C%20%3A%2C%20%3Aseq_len%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20activation%20is%20not%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20out%20%3D%20ACT2FN%5Bactivation%5D(out)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20out.to(hidden_states.dtype)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E7%9F%AD%E5%8D%B7%E7%A7%AF%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22Transformers%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhuggingface%2Ftransformers%2Fblob%2Fv5.17.0%2Fsrc%2Ftransformers%2Fmodels%2Fqwen3_5_moe%2Fmodeling_qwen3_5_moe.py%23L272-L291%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>Short Conv 的作用。</strong> K 经局部卷积后包含邻近 token 的组合特征，可作为局部 n-gram 地址；Q/V 的卷积分别补充局部查询与写入内容</li>
<li>令 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-237%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20C%22%7D"></card> 表示按通道独立计算的因果卷积。卷积后的 Q/K 尚未归一化，记为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-238%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22Q%5E0%2CK%5E0%22%7D"></card>。该阶段计算</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
[Q^0,K^0,V]&amp;=\operatorname{SiLU}\!\left(\mathcal C(P)\right),\\
\beta&amp;=\sigma(b),\\
g&amp;=-\exp(A_{\log})\odot\operatorname{softplus}(a+d_{\mathrm{bias}}),
\qquad \alpha=\exp(g),\\
\bar Q_h&amp;=Q^0_{\lfloor h/r\rfloor},\quad
\bar K_h=K^0_{\lfloor h/r\rfloor},\qquad r=H_V/H_K.
\end{aligned}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-239%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5BQ%5E0%2CK%5E0%2CV%5D%26%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathcal%20C(P)%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta%26%3D%5C%5Csigma(b)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cng%26%3D-%5C%5Cexp(A_%7B%5C%5Clog%7D)%5C%5Codot%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsoftplus%7D(a%2Bd_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbias%7D%7D)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Calpha%3D%5C%5Cexp(g)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cbar%20Q_h%26%3DQ%5E0_%7B%5C%5Clfloor%20h%2Fr%5C%5Crfloor%7D%2C%5C%5Cquad%5Cn%5C%5Cbar%20K_h%3DK%5E0_%7B%5C%5Clfloor%20h%2Fr%5C%5Crfloor%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20r%3DH_V%2FH_K.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>合并投影的输出在卷积时采用 <code>[batch, channels, time]</code> 排列，卷积后恢复时间优先布局，再拆分为多头 Q/K/V</li>
<li><code>A_log</code> 和 <code>dt_bias</code> 是每个 value head 的可学习参数。上述参数化保证 <code>g</code> 为负值，从而将历史衰减限制在 0 与 1 之间；<code>beta</code> 经 sigmoid 控制残差写入强度。Grouped Value Attention 通过 head 映射使多个 value head 共享 Q/K，模型代码使用 <code>repeat_interleave</code> 显式实现该映射。下面保留官方 <code>forward()</code>，包括无缓存计算与缓存接续分支</li>
<li><strong>输入投影。</strong> 先屏蔽 padding，判断是否已有缓存，再分别生成 Q/K/V、输出门 z、写入系数 b 和衰减参数 a。下面各段接续同一个 <code>forward()</code> 函数</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-240%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20forward(%5Cn%20%20%20%20self%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20hidden_states%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20cache_params%3A%20Cache%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20attention_mask%3A%20torch.Tensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20**kwargs%3A%20Unpack%5BTransformersKwargs%5D%2C%5Cn)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20hidden_states%20%3D%20apply_mask_to_padding_states(hidden_states%2C%20attention_mask)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20batch_size%2C%20seq_len%2C%20_%20%3D%20hidden_states.shape%5Cn%20%20%20%20use_precomputed_states%20%3D%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cache_params%20is%20not%20None%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20and%20cache_params.has_previous_state(self.layer_idx%2C%20state_idx%3D0)%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20mixed_qkv%20%3D%20self.in_proj_qkv(hidden_states)%5Cn%20%20%20%20mixed_qkv%20%3D%20mixed_qkv.transpose(1%2C%202)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20z%20%3D%20self.in_proj_z(hidden_states)%5Cn%20%20%20%20z%20%3D%20z.reshape(batch_size%2C%20seq_len%2C%20-1%2C%20self.head_v_dim)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20b%20%3D%20self.in_proj_b(hidden_states)%5Cn%20%20%20%20a%20%3D%20self.in_proj_a(hidden_states)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E6%8A%95%E5%BD%B1%E3%80%81%E9%97%A8%E6%8E%A7%E4%B8%8E%20Head%20%E6%98%A0%E5%B0%84%20%C2%B7%201%2F5%20%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E6%8A%95%E5%BD%B1%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22Transformers%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhuggingface%2Ftransformers%2Fblob%2Fv5.17.0%2Fsrc%2Ftransformers%2Fmodels%2Fqwen3_5_moe%2Fmodeling_qwen3_5_moe.py%23L552-L665%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>短卷积路径。</strong> 已有状态且只处理一个 token 时，更新卷积窗口；其他情况执行整段因果卷积，并在使用缓存时截取当前序列对应的输出</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-241%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20if%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20use_precomputed_states%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20and%20seq_len%20%3D%3D%201%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20and%20not%20cache_params.layers%5Bself.layer_idx%5D.record_past%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20conv_state%20%3D%20cache_params.layers%5Bself.layer_idx%5D.conv_states%5B0%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20mixed_qkv%20%3D%20causal_conv1d_update(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20mixed_qkv%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20conv_state%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.conv1d.weight.squeeze(1)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.conv1d.bias%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.activation%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20cache_params%20is%20not%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20mixed_qkv%20%3D%20cache_params.update_conv_state(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20mixed_qkv%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.layer_idx%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20conv_kernel_size%3Dself.conv_kernel_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20mixed_qkv%20%3D%20causal_conv1d_fn(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20mixed_qkv%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.conv1d.weight.squeeze(1)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.conv1d.bias%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20activation%3Dself.activation%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20**kwargs%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20cache_params%20is%20not%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20mixed_qkv%20%3D%20mixed_qkv%5B%3A%2C%20%3A%2C%20-seq_len%3A%5D%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E6%8A%95%E5%BD%B1%E3%80%81%E9%97%A8%E6%8E%A7%E4%B8%8E%20Head%20%E6%98%A0%E5%B0%84%20%C2%B7%202%2F5%20%E7%9F%AD%E5%8D%B7%E7%A7%AF%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22Transformers%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhuggingface%2Ftransformers%2Fblob%2Fv5.17.0%2Fsrc%2Ftransformers%2Fmodels%2Fqwen3_5_moe%2Fmodeling_qwen3_5_moe.py%23L552-L665%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>门控与 Head 映射。</strong> 卷积输出拆成 Q/K/V 并整理为多头布局。<code>sigmoid(b)</code> 得到写入系数，a 生成非正的对数衰减；value head 更多时，Q/K 沿 head 维复制</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-242%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20mixed_qkv%20%3D%20mixed_qkv.transpose(1%2C%202)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query%2C%20key%2C%20value%20%3D%20torch.split(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20mixed_qkv%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.key_dim%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.key_dim%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.value_dim%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20dim%3D-1%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20query%20%3D%20query.reshape(batch_size%2C%20seq_len%2C%20-1%2C%20self.head_k_dim)%5Cn%20%20%20%20key%20%3D%20key.reshape(batch_size%2C%20seq_len%2C%20-1%2C%20self.head_k_dim)%5Cn%20%20%20%20value%20%3D%20value.reshape(batch_size%2C%20seq_len%2C%20-1%2C%20self.head_v_dim)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20beta%20%3D%20b.sigmoid()%5Cn%20%20%20%20g%20%3D%20-self.A_log.float().exp()%20*%20F.softplus(a.float()%20%2B%20self.dt_bias)%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20self.num_v_heads%20%2F%2F%20self.num_k_heads%20%3E%201%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20query%20%3D%20query.repeat_interleave(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.num_v_heads%20%2F%2F%20self.num_k_heads%2C%20dim%3D2%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20key%20%3D%20key.repeat_interleave(self.num_v_heads%20%2F%2F%20self.num_k_heads%2C%20dim%3D2)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E6%8A%95%E5%BD%B1%E3%80%81%E9%97%A8%E6%8E%A7%E4%B8%8E%20Head%20%E6%98%A0%E5%B0%84%20%C2%B7%203%2F5%20%E9%97%A8%E6%8E%A7%E4%B8%8E%20Head%20%E6%98%A0%E5%B0%84%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22Transformers%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhuggingface%2Ftransformers%2Fblob%2Fv5.17.0%2Fsrc%2Ftransformers%2Fmodels%2Fqwen3_5_moe%2Fmodeling_qwen3_5_moe.py%23L552-L665%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>选择状态算子。</strong> 有缓存的单 token 输入使用 recurrent 路径，其他输入使用 chunk 路径。两条路径都接收相同的门控与初始状态，并按需返回末态</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-243%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20recurrent_state%20%3D%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cache_params.layers%5Bself.layer_idx%5D.recurrent_states%5B0%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20use_precomputed_states%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20else%20None%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20use_precomputed_states%20and%20seq_len%20%3D%3D%201%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20core_attn_out%2C%20last_recurrent_state%20%3D%20torch_recurrent_gated_delta_rule(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20query%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20key%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20value%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20beta%3Dbeta%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20initial_state%3Drecurrent_state%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20output_final_state%3Dcache_params%20is%20not%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20use_qk_l2norm_in_kernel%3DTrue%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dkwargs.pop(%5C%22cu_seq_lens_q%5C%22%2C%20None)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20**kwargs%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20core_attn_out%2C%20last_recurrent_state%20%3D%20torch_chunk_gated_delta_rule(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20query%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20key%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20value%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20beta%3Dbeta%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20initial_state%3Drecurrent_state%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20output_final_state%3Dcache_params%20is%20not%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20use_qk_l2norm_in_kernel%3DTrue%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dkwargs.pop(%5C%22cu_seq_lens_q%5C%22%2C%20None)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20**kwargs%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E6%8A%95%E5%BD%B1%E3%80%81%E9%97%A8%E6%8E%A7%E4%B8%8E%20Head%20%E6%98%A0%E5%B0%84%20%C2%B7%204%2F5%20%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E7%AE%97%E5%AD%90%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22Transformers%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhuggingface%2Ftransformers%2Fblob%2Fv5.17.0%2Fsrc%2Ftransformers%2Fmodels%2Fqwen3_5_moe%2Fmodeling_qwen3_5_moe.py%23L552-L665%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>状态回写与输出投影。</strong> 末态写回缓存，状态读出按 value head 归一化并由 z 门控，再通过 <code>out_proj</code> 映射回模型隐藏维度</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-244%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20if%20cache_params%20is%20not%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cache_params.update_recurrent_state(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20last_recurrent_state%2C%20self.layer_idx%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20core_attn_out%20%3D%20core_attn_out.reshape(-1%2C%20self.head_v_dim)%5Cn%20%20%20%20z%20%3D%20z.reshape(-1%2C%20self.head_v_dim)%5Cn%20%20%20%20core_attn_out%20%3D%20self.norm(core_attn_out%2C%20z)%5Cn%20%20%20%20core_attn_out%20%3D%20core_attn_out.reshape(batch_size%2C%20seq_len%2C%20-1)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20output%20%3D%20self.out_proj(core_attn_out)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20output%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E6%8A%95%E5%BD%B1%E3%80%81%E9%97%A8%E6%8E%A7%E4%B8%8E%20Head%20%E6%98%A0%E5%B0%84%20%C2%B7%205%2F5%20%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E5%9B%9E%E5%86%99%E4%B8%8E%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%8A%95%E5%BD%B1%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22Transformers%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhuggingface%2Ftransformers%2Fblob%2Fv5.17.0%2Fsrc%2Ftransformers%2Fmodels%2Fqwen3_5_moe%2Fmodeling_qwen3_5_moe.py%23L552-L665%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>解码时的卷积缓存。</strong> 单 token 解码沿用相同的短卷积，只需接续缓存中的最近投影，按上述 Short Conv 公式计算当前位置。<code>conv_state</code> 保存短卷积输入，GDN 的 <code>recurrent_state</code> 保存矩阵状态；两份缓存分别对应局部窗口与长期递推。下面是 <code>causal_conv1d_update</code> 的实际后备实现：先拼接缓存与新输入，原位保留最近窗口，再取最后 <code>seq_len</code> 个卷积输出</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-245%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20causal_conv1d_update(%5Cn%20%20%20%20hidden_states%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20conv_state%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20weight%3A%20nn.Parameter%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20bias%3A%20nn.Parameter%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20activation%3A%20str%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20_%2C%20hidden_size%2C%20seq_len%20%3D%20hidden_states.shape%5Cn%20%20%20%20state_len%20%3D%20conv_state.shape%5B-1%5D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20hidden_states_new%20%3D%20torch.cat(%5Bconv_state%2C%20hidden_states%5D%2C%20dim%3D-1).to(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20weight.dtype%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20conv_state.copy_(hidden_states_new%5B%3A%2C%20%3A%2C%20-state_len%3A%5D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20out%20%3D%20F.conv1d(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20hidden_states_new%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20weight.unsqueeze(1)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20bias%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20padding%3D0%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20groups%3Dhidden_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20out%20%3D%20out%5B%3A%2C%20%3A%2C%20-seq_len%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20activation%20is%20not%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20out%20%3D%20ACT2FN%5Bactivation%5D(out)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20out.to(hidden_states.dtype)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E5%8D%B7%E7%A7%AF%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22Transformers%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhuggingface%2Ftransformers%2Fblob%2Fv5.17.0%2Fsrc%2Ftransformers%2Fmodels%2Fqwen3_5_moe%2Fmodeling_qwen3_5_moe.py%23L252-L268%22%7D%7D"></card>
<h2 id="状态算子与输出门控">状态算子与输出门控</h2>
<ul>
<li>Q/K 在进入状态更新前沿每个 head 的特征维归一化。记 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-246%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20D%22%7D"></card> 为 Gated Delta Rule 算子，则输入归一化、状态计算和输出映射可写为</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
q_{t,h}&amp;=\frac{\bar q_{t,h}}{\sqrt{\|\bar q_{t,h}\|_2^2+\varepsilon}},
&amp;k_{t,h}&amp;=\frac{\bar k_{t,h}}{\sqrt{\|\bar k_{t,h}\|_2^2+\varepsilon}},\\
(O,S_{\mathrm{final}})&amp;=\mathcal D(Q,K,V,g,\beta;S_{\mathrm{initial}}),\\
Y&amp;=\operatorname{Concat}_{h}\!\left[
\operatorname{RMSNorm}(O_h)\odot\operatorname{SiLU}(Z_h)
\right]W_o^\top.
\end{aligned}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-247%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cnq_%7Bt%2Ch%7D%26%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbar%20q_%7Bt%2Ch%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cbar%20q_%7Bt%2Ch%7D%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%7D%2C%5Cn%26k_%7Bt%2Ch%7D%26%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbar%20k_%7Bt%2Ch%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cbar%20k_%7Bt%2Ch%7D%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn(O%2CS_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bfinal%7D%7D)%26%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%20D(Q%2CK%2CV%2Cg%2C%5C%5Cbeta%3BS_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binitial%7D%7D)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5CnY%26%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BConcat%7D_%7Bh%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D(O_h)%5C%5Codot%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D(Z_h)%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5DW_o%5E%5C%5Ctop.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>Chunk 与 recurrent 实现同一个状态算子。模型根据输入长度和已有状态选择计算方式：完整序列使用 chunk；存在缓存且输入长度为 1 时使用 recurrent。两者均返回当前输出；启用缓存时还返回序列末态并回写缓存，供后续输入接续计算</li>
<li>输出归一化独立作用于每个 value head。<code>self.norm</code> 先执行 RMSNorm，再乘 <code>SiLU(z)</code>；head 维合并后，<code>out_proj</code> 将结果映射回模型隐藏维度。以下摘录官方状态计算与输出分支</li>
<li><strong>Chunk 与 Recurrent 分支。</strong> 这一段读取缓存中的 recurrent state，再依据序列长度和缓存状态选择算子；Q/K 的 L2 归一化由算子内部完成</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-248%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22recurrent_state%20%3D%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20cache_params.layers%5Bself.layer_idx%5D.recurrent_states%5B0%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20use_precomputed_states%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%20None%5Cn)%5Cnif%20use_precomputed_states%20and%20seq_len%20%3D%3D%201%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20core_attn_out%2C%20last_recurrent_state%20%3D%20torch_recurrent_gated_delta_rule(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20query%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20key%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20value%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20beta%3Dbeta%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20initial_state%3Drecurrent_state%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20output_final_state%3Dcache_params%20is%20not%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20use_qk_l2norm_in_kernel%3DTrue%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dkwargs.pop(%5C%22cu_seq_lens_q%5C%22%2C%20None)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20**kwargs%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cnelse%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20core_attn_out%2C%20last_recurrent_state%20%3D%20torch_chunk_gated_delta_rule(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20query%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20key%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20value%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20beta%3Dbeta%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20initial_state%3Drecurrent_state%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20output_final_state%3Dcache_params%20is%20not%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20use_qk_l2norm_in_kernel%3DTrue%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dkwargs.pop(%5C%22cu_seq_lens_q%5C%22%2C%20None)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20**kwargs%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E8%AF%BB%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%8E%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E9%97%A8%E6%8E%A7%20%C2%B7%201%2F2%20Chunk%20%E4%B8%8E%20Recurrent%20%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22Transformers%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhuggingface%2Ftransformers%2Fblob%2Fv5.17.0%2Fsrc%2Ftransformers%2Fmodels%2Fqwen3_5_moe%2Fmodeling_qwen3_5_moe.py%23L626-L665%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>输出门与缓存更新。</strong> 算子返回后先更新 recurrent state，再对各 head 的读出执行门控归一化，最后合并 head 并做输出投影</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-249%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22if%20cache_params%20is%20not%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20cache_params.update_recurrent_state(last_recurrent_state%2C%20self.layer_idx)%5Cn%5Cncore_attn_out%20%3D%20core_attn_out.reshape(-1%2C%20self.head_v_dim)%5Cnz%20%3D%20z.reshape(-1%2C%20self.head_v_dim)%5Cncore_attn_out%20%3D%20self.norm(core_attn_out%2C%20z)%5Cncore_attn_out%20%3D%20core_attn_out.reshape(batch_size%2C%20seq_len%2C%20-1)%5Cn%5Cnoutput%20%3D%20self.out_proj(core_attn_out)%5Cnreturn%20output%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E8%AF%BB%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%8E%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E9%97%A8%E6%8E%A7%20%C2%B7%202%2F2%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E9%97%A8%E4%B8%8E%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22Transformers%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhuggingface%2Ftransformers%2Fblob%2Fv5.17.0%2Fsrc%2Ftransformers%2Fmodels%2Fqwen3_5_moe%2Fmodeling_qwen3_5_moe.py%23L626-L665%22%7D%7D"></card>
</section><section class="lake-revised-section">
<h1 id="chunk-wise-算法代码解析">Chunk-wise 算法代码解析</h1>
<h2 id="前向计算的矩阵分解">前向计算的矩阵分解</h2>
<ul>
<li>以下对应 FLA v0.5.2 的 Triton 实现，采用 scalar gate、<code>state_v_first=False</code>。记 <code>H</code> 为 Q/K head 数、<code>HV</code> 为 value head 数，代码中的 <code>K/V</code> 分别对应数学维度 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-250%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d_k%2Fd_v%22%7D"></card>，<code>BT=64</code> 为 chunk 长度</li>
<li>论文状态 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-251%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%20R%5E%7Bd_v%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%22%7D"></card> 在这一路径中按 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-252%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20H%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%20R%5E%7Bd_k%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%22%7D"></card> 存放，所以代码中的读出是 <code>q @ h</code>，写入是 <code>k.T @ residual</code>。<code>state_v_first=True</code> 改变存储排列，不改变状态更新的数学定义。<code>HV/H</code> 个 value head 可共享同一个 Q/K head，但各自拥有 gate、beta 和状态</li>
<li>Chunk 前向围绕论文中的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-253%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-254%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-255%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card> 和 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-256%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20O_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card> 展开。计算顺序为：累计门控、构造 KKT、求解下三角系统、生成 W/U、递推状态、计算输出。其中状态与输出复用同一个残差</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf V_{\mathrm{new},[t]}=
\widetilde{\mathbf U}_{[t]}-
\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}_{[t]}\mathbf S_{[t]}^\top.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-257%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnew%7D%2C%5Bt%5D%7D%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D-%5Cn%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li><code>chunk_gated_delta_rule_fwd_intra</code> 构造并求解块内系统，生成逆矩阵 <code>A</code>、<code>u</code> 和 <code>w</code>；<code>chunk_gated_delta_rule_fwd_h</code> 引入块入口状态，计算 <code>v_new</code> 及下一块状态；<code>chunk_fwd_o</code> 完成输出计算。这里 <code>h</code> 保存所有块的入口状态，<code>final_state</code> 保存各序列的最终状态</li>
<li>默认 64-token 路径将 KKT 构造与下三角求解融合执行，随后单独生成 W/U。下面给出前向入口，块内分析采用固定长度、无 context parallelism、外部已计算 gate 的默认分支</li>
<li><strong>累计衰减门。</strong> <code>chunk_gated_delta_rule_fwd()</code> 先得到 chunk 内的累计对数衰减。若 gate 在 kernel 内生成，就同时完成 gate 计算和前缀和；否则直接对输入 g 累加</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-258%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20chunk_gated_delta_rule_fwd(%5Cn%20%20%20%20q%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20k%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20v%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20g%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20beta%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20scale%3A%20float%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20initial_state%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20output_final_state%3A%20bool%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20state_v_first%3A%20bool%20%3D%20False%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3A%20torch.LongTensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20cp_context%3A%20FLACPContext%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%3A%20torch.LongTensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20use_gate_in_kernel%3A%20bool%20%3D%20False%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20A_log%3A%20torch.Tensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20dt_bias%3A%20torch.Tensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20chunk_size%3A%20int%20%3D%2064%2C%5Cn)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20g_input%20%3D%20g%20if%20use_gate_in_kernel%20else%20None%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20use_gate_in_kernel%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%20%3D%20gdn_gate_chunk_cumsum(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20A_log%3DA_log%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_size%3Dchunk_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20scale%3DRCP_LN2%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20dt_bias%3Ddt_bias%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dcu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%3Dchunk_indices%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%20%3D%20chunk_local_cumsum(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_size%3Dchunk_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20scale%3DRCP_LN2%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dcu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%3Dchunk_indices%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22Chunk%20%E5%89%8D%E5%90%91%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%20%C2%B7%201%2F3%20%E7%B4%AF%E8%AE%A1%E8%A1%B0%E5%87%8F%E9%97%A8%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Fchunk.py%23L33-L123%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>块内变换与入口状态。</strong> <code>chunk_gated_delta_rule_fwd_intra()</code> 构造三角逆 A 及变换后的 W/U。启用上下文并行时，再准备各分片所需的入口状态</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-259%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20w%2C%20u%2C%20A%20%3D%20chunk_gated_delta_rule_fwd_intra(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k%3Dk%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20v%3Dv%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20beta%3Dbeta%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dcu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%3Dchunk_indices%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_size%3Dchunk_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20cp_context%20is%20not%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20initial_state%20%3D%20chunk_gated_delta_rule_fwd_h_pre_process(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k%3Dk%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20w%3Dw%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20u%3Du%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dcu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20initial_state%3Dinitial_state%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20context%3Dcp_context%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20state_v_first%3Dstate_v_first%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_size%3Dchunk_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22Chunk%20%E5%89%8D%E5%90%91%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%20%C2%B7%202%2F3%20%E5%9D%97%E5%86%85%E5%8F%98%E6%8D%A2%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Fchunk.py%23L33-L123%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>状态递推与读出。</strong> 状态 kernel 生成各块入口状态 h、残差 <code>v_new</code> 和末态；输出 kernel 再把历史状态贡献与块内贡献合并。返回值也保留反向重计算所需的量</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-260%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20h%2C%20v_new%2C%20final_state%20%3D%20chunk_gated_delta_rule_fwd_h(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k%3Dk%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20w%3Dw%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20u%3Du%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20initial_state%3Dinitial_state%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20output_final_state%3Doutput_final_state%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dcu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%3Dchunk_indices%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20state_v_first%3Dstate_v_first%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_size%3Dchunk_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20cp_context%20is%20not%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20initial_state%20%3D%20compress_h0(initial_state%2C%20context%3Dcp_context)%5Cn%20%20%20%20o%20%3D%20chunk_fwd_o(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20q%3Dq%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k%3Dk%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20v%3Dv_new%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20h%3Dh%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20scale%3Dscale%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dcu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%3Dchunk_indices%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20state_v_first%3Dstate_v_first%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_size%3Dchunk_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20(g%2C%20o%2C%20A%2C%20final_state%2C%20initial_state%2C%20g_input)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22Chunk%20%E5%89%8D%E5%90%91%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%20%C2%B7%203%2F3%20%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E9%80%92%E6%8E%A8%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%BB%E5%87%BA%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Fchunk.py%23L33-L123%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>分块与逐 token 递推的等价性。</strong> 在一个 chunk 内省略块编号，令 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-261%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%5C%5Cbeta%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta)%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-262%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cgamma)%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-263%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20H_0%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card>，把实际写入向量按行组成 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-264%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20E%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnew%7D%2C%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card>。位置 i 的残差必须扣除入口状态和此前写入在当前 key 上的预测</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\boldsymbol e_i=\beta_i\left(\boldsymbol v_i-\gamma_i\mathbf H_0^\top\boldsymbol k_i-\sum_{j&lt;i}\frac{\gamma_i}{\gamma_j}(\boldsymbol k_i^\top\boldsymbol k_j)\boldsymbol e_j\right).
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-265%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20e_i%3D%5C%5Cbeta_i%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_i-%5C%5Cgamma_i%5C%5Cmathbf%20H_0%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_i-%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%3Ci%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_i%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_j%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_i%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_j)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20e_j%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>将依赖此前残差的项移到左侧，就得到单位下三角系统。令 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-266%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BstrictLower%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%5C%5Cbeta(%5C%5CGamma%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5E%5C%5Ctop))%22%7D"></card>，则</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="(\mathbf I+\mathbf A)\mathbf E=\mathbf B_\beta\mathbf V-\mathbf B_\beta\mathbf D\mathbf K\mathbf H_0,\qquad \mathbf E=\widetilde{\mathbf U}-\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}\mathbf H_0.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-267%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A)%5C%5Cmathbf%20E%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Cmathbf%20V-%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Cmathbf%20D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5C%5Cmathbf%20H_0%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%20E%3D%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D-%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20H_0.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>U 和 W 独立于入口状态生成，入口状态确定后通过矩阵乘法和相减计算残差。块内的 token 依赖被三角求解吸收，块间依赖则由状态递推承担</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="累积门控将连乘转为前缀和">累积门控：将连乘转为前缀和</h2>
<ul>
<li>逐 token 的输入为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-268%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%3D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Calpha_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%22%7D"></card>。对每个 chunk 独立求前缀和，即得到累计衰减的对数</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\widehat g_{[t]}^r=\frac{1}{\ln 2}\sum_{i=1}^{r}g_{[t]}^i,
\qquad \gamma_{[t]}^r=2^{\widehat g_{[t]}^r},
\qquad \frac{\gamma_{[t]}^r}{\gamma_{[t]}^i}
=2^{\widehat g_{[t]}^r-\widehat g_{[t]}^i}.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-269%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidehat%20g_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Cln%202%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7Dg_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D2%5E%7B%5C%5Cwidehat%20g_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5Cn%3D2%5E%7B%5C%5Cwidehat%20g_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er-%5C%5Cwidehat%20g_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>算子位于 <code>fla/ops/utils/cumsum.py</code>，标量 kernel 的网格为 <code>(NT, B * H)</code>：每个 program 负责一个 chunk 和一个 gate head。<code>o_t</code> 构造块内 token 索引，<code>m_t</code> 屏蔽尾块越界位置；按 <code>[B, T, H]</code> 布局加载后，<code>tl.cumsum</code> 沿时间轴执行前缀和。累积在 FP32 中完成，并通过 <code>RCP_LN2</code> 将自然对数转换为以 2 为底的对数。后续 kernel 使用 <code>exp2</code> 还原整体衰减和区间衰减，避免在各阶段重复计算连乘</li>
<li><strong>定位序列与 Chunk。</strong> 每个 program 对应一个 chunk 和一个 gate head。变长输入通过 <code>chunk_indices</code> 与 <code>cu_seqlens</code> 找到序列边界，定长输入直接由 batch 编号计算起点</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-270%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%40triton.jit(do_not_specialize%3D%5B'T'%5D)%5Cndef%20chunk_local_cumsum_scalar_kernel(%5Cn%20%20%20%20s%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20o%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20scale%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20T%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20B%3A%20tl.constexpr%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20H%3A%20tl.constexpr%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20BT%3A%20tl.constexpr%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20REVERSE%3A%20tl.constexpr%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20HAS_SCALE%3A%20tl.constexpr%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20IS_VARLEN%3A%20tl.constexpr%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20HEAD_FIRST%3A%20tl.constexpr%2C%5Cn)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20i_t%2C%20i_bh%20%3D%20tl.program_id(0).to(tl.int64)%2C%20tl.program_id(1)%5Cn%20%20%20%20i_b%2C%20i_h%20%3D%20i_bh%20%2F%2F%20H%2C%20i_bh%20%25%20H%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20IS_VARLEN%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20i_n%2C%20i_t%20%3D%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20tl.load(chunk_indices%20%2B%20i_t%20*%202).to(tl.int32)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20tl.load(chunk_indices%20%2B%20i_t%20*%202%20%2B%201).to(tl.int64)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20bos%2C%20eos%20%3D%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20tl.load(cu_seqlens%20%2B%20i_n).to(tl.int32)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20tl.load(cu_seqlens%20%2B%20i_n%20%2B%201).to(tl.int32)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20T%20%3D%20eos%20-%20bos%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20bos%2C%20eos%20%3D%20i_b%20*%20T%2C%20i_b%20*%20T%20%2B%20T%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E7%B4%AF%E8%AE%A1%E5%AF%B9%E6%95%B0%E9%97%A8%E6%8E%A7%20%C2%B7%201%2F2%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%BD%8D%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E4%B8%8E%20Chunk%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Futils%2Fcumsum.py%23L33-L73%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>前缀和与写回。</strong> 沿时间维加载有效 gate，在 FP32 中计算 <code>tl.cumsum</code>；<code>REVERSE</code> 可将其转换为后缀和，<code>HAS_SCALE</code> 控制缩放，最后只写回有效位置</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-271%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20o_t%20%3D%20i_t%20*%20BT%20%2B%20tl.arange(0%2C%20BT)%5Cn%20%20%20%20m_t%20%3D%20o_t%20%3C%20T%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_s%20%3D%20s%20%2B%20bos%20*%20H%20%2B%20i_h%20%2B%20o_t%20*%20H%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_o%20%3D%20o%20%2B%20bos%20*%20H%20%2B%20i_h%20%2B%20o_t%20*%20H%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%5BBT%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_s%20%3D%20tl.load(p_s%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%2C%20other%3D0.0).to(tl.float32)%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_o%20%3D%20tl.cumsum(b_s%2C%20axis%3D0)%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20REVERSE%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_z%20%3D%20tl.sum(b_s%2C%20axis%3D0)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_o%20%3D%20-b_o%20%2B%20b_z%5BNone%5D%20%2B%20b_s%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20HAS_SCALE%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_o%20*%3D%20scale%5Cn%20%20%20%20tl.store(p_o%2C%20b_o.to(p_o.dtype.element_ty)%2C%20mask%3Dm_t)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E7%B4%AF%E8%AE%A1%E5%AF%B9%E6%95%B0%E9%97%A8%E6%8E%A7%20%C2%B7%202%2F2%20%E5%89%8D%E7%BC%80%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%8E%E5%86%99%E5%9B%9E%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Futils%2Fcumsum.py%23L33-L73%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><code>REVERSE</code> 分支计算后缀和：<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-272%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%5C%5Cge%20i%7Dx_j%3D%5C%5Csum_jx_j-%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%5C%5Cle%20i%7Dx_j%2Bx_i%22%7D"></card>，对应前缀和的反向传播。<code>HAS_SCALE</code> 决定是否乘调用侧传入的缩放，GDN 前向传入 <code>RCP_LN2</code>。上述代码保留时间优先的访存分支</li>
<li>每个 chunk 独立累计 gate。块前历史已经包含在入口状态中，再乘当前块的累计衰减即可；因此前缀和不需要跨 chunk 延伸。对于变长输入，块索引同时指定序列编号和序列内块编号，累计过程不能跨越序列边界</li>
<li>对非正的逐 token gate，因果方向的累计差 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-273%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidehat%20g_i-%5C%5Cwidehat%20g_j%22%7D"></card>（<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-274%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%5C%5Cge%20j%22%7D"></card>）也非正，<code>exp2</code> 得到 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-275%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(0%2C1%5D%22%7D"></card> 内的衰减。实现直接对累计对数作差，不先生成很小的 gamma 再相除，避免长衰减下出现 <code>0/0</code>。<code>g</code> 在前缀和之后已表示 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-276%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidehat%20g%22%7D"></card>，不再是原来的逐 token 自然对数 gate</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="kkt构造块内递推系数">KKT：构造块内递推系数</h2>
<ul>
<li>名称 KKT 指 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-277%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card> 的 key Gram 矩阵。对角线必须排除：当前 value 的直接写入已放在三角系统右侧，若再把自身 key 内积放入左侧，就会改变 Delta Rule 的更新</li>
<li>第 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-278%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%22%7D"></card> 个位置的 Delta 修正依赖更早位置的 key 内积。更新系数按行缩放，区间衰减逐元素作用于 Gram 矩阵，得到</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
\mathbf A_{[t]}&amp;=\operatorname{strictLower}\!\left(
\operatorname{diag}(\beta_{[t]})
\left(\Gamma_{[t]}\odot\mathbf K_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}^\top\right)\right),\\
(\mathbf A_{[t]})_{ij}&amp;=
\begin{cases}
\beta_{[t]}^i\,2^{\widehat g_{[t]}^i-\widehat g_{[t]}^j}
\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^{i\top}\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^j,&amp;i&gt;j,\\
0,&amp;i\le j.
\end{cases}
\end{aligned}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-279%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%26%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BstrictLower%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn(%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)_%7Bij%7D%26%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5C%5C%2C2%5E%7B%5C%5Cwidehat%20g_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei-%5C%5Cwidehat%20g_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%2C%26i%3Ej%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn0%2C%26i%5C%5Cle%20j.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li><code>fla/ops/common/chunk_scaled_dot_kkt.py</code> 的 <code>chunk_scaled_dot_kkt_fwd_kernel</code> 实现这一计算。网格为 <code>(NT, B * HV)</code>，每个 program 生成一个 head 的块内系数。K 维按 <code>BK</code> 分片，<code>tl.dot(b_k, tl.trans(b_k))</code> 将各片段的内积累加到 FP32 的 <code>[BT, BT]</code> 矩阵中</li>
<li>这是 16/32-token 分步路径使用的 kernel；64-token 默认路径将相同计算与下三角求解融合。独立 KKT 对应内积、衰减、beta、严格下三角四个矩阵操作</li>
<li><strong>定位 chunk 并累计 Gram 矩阵。</strong> <code>chunk_indices</code> 给出序列编号与序列内块编号，<code>cu_seqlens</code> 确定起点 <code>bos</code> 和有效长度 T；定长分支直接通过 batch 编号计算起点。K 维按 <code>BK</code> 分片，逐片累加 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-280%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card>。<code>i_h // (HV // H)</code> 将 value head 映射到共享的 key head；K 的时间步长为 <code>H * K</code>，beta 的时间步长为 <code>HV</code>。<code>m_t</code> 屏蔽尾块的无效 token</li>
<li><strong>定位 KKT 的有效区间。</strong> kernel 先定位序列、chunk 和 value head，并构造时间索引与尾块掩码。后续访存都以这里确定的 <code>bos</code> 和有效长度为边界</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-281%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%40triton.jit(do_not_specialize%3D%5B'T'%5D)%5Cndef%20chunk_scaled_dot_kkt_fwd_kernel(%5Cn%20%20%20%20k%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20g%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20beta%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20A%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20T%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20H%3A%20tl.constexpr%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20HV%3A%20tl.constexpr%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20K%3A%20tl.constexpr%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20BT%3A%20tl.constexpr%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20BK%3A%20tl.constexpr%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20IS_VARLEN%3A%20tl.constexpr%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20USE_G%3A%20tl.constexpr%2C%5Cn)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20i_t%2C%20i_bh%20%3D%20tl.program_id(0).to(tl.int64)%2C%20tl.program_id(1).to(tl.int64)%5Cn%20%20%20%20i_b%2C%20i_h%20%3D%20i_bh%20%2F%2F%20HV%2C%20i_bh%20%25%20HV%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20IS_VARLEN%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20i_n%2C%20i_t%20%3D%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20tl.load(chunk_indices%20%2B%20i_t%20*%202).to(tl.int32)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20tl.load(chunk_indices%20%2B%20i_t%20*%202%20%2B%201).to(tl.int64)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20bos%2C%20eos%20%3D%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20tl.load(cu_seqlens%20%2B%20i_n).to(tl.int32)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20tl.load(cu_seqlens%20%2B%20i_n%20%2B%201).to(tl.int32)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20T%20%3D%20eos%20-%20bos%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20bos%2C%20eos%20%3D%20i_b%20*%20T%2C%20i_b%20*%20T%20%2B%20T%5Cn%20%20%20%20o_t%20%3D%20i_t%20*%20BT%20%2B%20tl.arange(0%2C%20BT)%5Cn%20%20%20%20m_t%20%3D%20o_t%20%3C%20T%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%9D%97%E5%86%85%20Gram%20%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5%20%C2%B7%201%2F2%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%BD%8D%20KKT%20%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E5%8C%BA%E9%97%B4%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fcommon%2Fchunk_scaled_dot_kkt.py%23L33-L80%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>分片累计 Gram 矩阵。</strong> 加载每个位置的 beta 后，沿 K 维分片读取 key。每片的 <code>K @ K.T</code> 累加到 FP32 矩阵 <code>b_A</code>；value head 通过整数除法映射到共享的 key head</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-282%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20p_b%20%3D%20beta%20%2B%20bos%20*%20HV%20%2B%20i_h%20%2B%20o_t%20*%20HV%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_b%20%3D%20tl.load(p_b%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_A%20%3D%20tl.zeros(%5BBT%2C%20BT%5D%2C%20dtype%3Dtl.float32)%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20i_k%20in%20range(tl.cdiv(K%2C%20BK))%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20o_k%20%3D%20i_k%20*%20BK%20%2B%20tl.arange(0%2C%20BK)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20p_k%20%3D%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2B%20(bos%20*%20H%20%2B%20i_h%20%2F%2F%20(HV%20%2F%2F%20H))%20*%20K%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2B%20o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20(H%20*%20K)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2B%20o_k%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_k%20%3D%20tl.load(p_k%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20(o_k%20%3C%20K)%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_A%20%2B%3D%20tl.dot(b_k%2C%20tl.trans(b_k))%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%9D%97%E5%86%85%20Gram%20%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5%20%C2%B7%202%2F2%20%E5%88%86%E7%89%87%E7%B4%AF%E8%AE%A1%20Gram%20%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fcommon%2Fchunk_scaled_dot_kkt.py%23L33-L80%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>施加区间衰减、写入系数和因果约束。</strong> <code>exp2(b_g_diff)</code> 计算区间衰减 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-283%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)_%7Bij%7D%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%2F%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%22%7D"></card> 并逐元素乘入 Gram 矩阵；<code>b_b[:, None]</code> 按行乘 beta，<code>m_A</code> 仅保留 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-284%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%3Ej%22%7D"></card> 的系数。结果通过 <code>p_A</code> 按 <code>[B, T, HV, BT]</code> 写回，每个有效 token 保存所在块的一行系数。以下代码接续上一段的 kernel 函数体</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-285%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22if%20USE_G%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_g%20%3D%20g%20%2B%20bos%20*%20HV%20%2B%20i_h%20%2B%20o_t%20*%20HV%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_g%20%3D%20tl.load(p_g%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_g_diff%20%3D%20b_g%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20-%20b_g%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_A%20*%3D%20exp2(b_g_diff)%5Cnb_A%20*%3D%20b_b%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%5Cn%5Cnm_A%20%3D%20(o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%3E%20o_t%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D)%20%26%20(m_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_t)%5Cnb_A%20%3D%20tl.where(m_A%2C%20b_A%2C%200)%5Cnp_A%20%3D%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2B%20(bos%20*%20HV%20%2B%20i_h)%20*%20BT%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2B%20o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20(BT%20*%20HV)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2B%20tl.arange(0%2C%20BT)%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn)%5Cntl.store(p_A%2C%20b_A.to(p_A.dtype.element_ty)%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E6%96%BD%E5%8A%A0%E8%A1%B0%E5%87%8F%E4%B8%8E%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fcommon%2Fchunk_scaled_dot_kkt.py%23L33-L80%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li>64-token 融合 kernel 位于 <code>fla/ops/gated_delta_rule/chunk_fwd.py</code>，名称为 <code>chunk_gated_delta_rule_fwd_kkt_solve_kernel</code>。它将时间维拆成四个 16-token 子块，只计算四个对角块和六个非对角下三角块；对角块额外应用严格下三角掩码。这十个子矩阵保留在寄存器中，直接进入前代与合并阶段</li>
<li><strong>融合路径的边界掩码。</strong> 四个子块的起点为 <code>i_tc0</code> 至 <code>i_tc3</code>，<code>o_i=tl.arange(0, 16)</code>；<code>m_tc0</code> 至 <code>m_tc3</code> 分别判断位置是否有效。以对角块 (0,0) 和非对角块 (1,0) 为例，默认融合 kernel 的衰减与 beta 处理为</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-286%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22m_d%20%3D%20o_i%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%3E%20o_i%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cnm_I%20%3D%20o_i%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%3D%3D%20o_i%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cnb_A00%20*%3D%20tl.where(%5Cn%20%20%20%20m_d%20%26%20m_tc0%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_tc0%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20exp2(b_g0%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20-%20b_g0%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%200.0%2C%5Cn)%5Cnb_A10%20*%3D%20tl.where(%5Cn%20%20%20%20m_tc1%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_tc0%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%2C%20exp2(b_g1%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20-%20b_g0%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D)%2C%200.0%5Cn)%5Cnb_A00%20%3D%20b_A00%20*%20b_b0%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%5Cnb_A10%20%3D%20b_A10%20*%20b_b1%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E8%9E%8D%E5%90%88%20KKT%20%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%89%E8%A7%92%E6%B1%82%E8%A7%A3%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Fchunk_fwd.py%23L40-L328%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li>非对角块 (1,0) 的所有有效元素都满足行位置晚于列位置，因而不需要额外的局部三角掩码。beta 总取行所属子块；gate 则用行子块减列子块。尾块无效位置的 gate 会以 0 加载，若直接乘其指数差，可能出现 <code>0 * inf</code>；融合实现先用 <code>tl.where</code> 把无效衰减置零，再与 Gram 矩阵相乘</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="下三角求解局部前代与块间合并">下三角求解：局部前代与块间合并</h2>
<ul>
<li>上一步得到严格下三角矩阵 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-287%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card>。包含 beta 的完整 UT 变换为</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf T_{[t]}=
\left[\mathbf I+\operatorname{strictLower}\!\left(
\operatorname{diag}(\beta_{[t]})
\left(\Gamma_{[t]}\odot\mathbf K_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}^\top\right)
\right)\right]^{-1}\operatorname{diag}(\beta_{[t]}).
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-288%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20T_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BstrictLower%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D).%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-289%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card> 是对角线为 1 的下三角矩阵，可用前代法逐行求解其逆。kernel 只生成逆矩阵；右端的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-290%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%22%7D"></card> 留到 W/U 阶段相乘。因此，求解后的代码变量 <code>A</code> 对应 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-291%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5E%7B-1%7D%22%7D"></card>，尚不是完整的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-292%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20T_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card></li>
<li><code>fla/ops/utils/solve_tril.py</code> 采用两级分块：先对 16×16 对角块逐行前代，再通过分块矩阵公式合并。<code>BT=16</code> 使用 <code>solve_tril_16x16_kernel</code>，<code>BT=32/64</code> 分别使用 <code>merge_16x16_to_32x32_inverse_kernel</code> 与 <code>merge_16x16_to_64x64_inverse_kernel</code>。当前 GDN 默认 64-token 路径进一步将 KKT 与这两级求解融合到 <code>chunk_gated_delta_rule_fwd_kkt_solve_kernel</code>；以下分段摘录该 kernel 的实际代码</li>
<li><strong>16×16 对角块前代。</strong> 以第一个对角块为例，<code>b_A00</code> 对应严格下三角子块 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-293%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B00%7D%22%7D"></card>，<code>b_Ai00</code> 最终对应 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-294%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B00%7D%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B00%7D)%5E%7B-1%7D%22%7D"></card>。对块内元素，前代关系为</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="(\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{00})_{ii}=1,\qquad
(\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{00})_{ij}
=-(\mathbf A_{00})_{ij}
-\sum_{k=j+1}^{i-1}(\mathbf A_{00})_{ik}
(\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{00})_{kj}\quad(i&gt;j).
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-295%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B00%7D)_%7Bii%7D%3D1%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn(%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B00%7D)_%7Bij%7D%5Cn%3D-(%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B00%7D)_%7Bij%7D%5Cn-%5C%5Csum_%7Bk%3Dj%2B1%7D%5E%7Bi-1%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B00%7D)_%7Bik%7D%5Cn(%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B00%7D)_%7Bkj%7D%5C%5Cquad(i%3Ej).%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-296%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b_Ai00%20%3D%20-b_A00%5Cnfor%20i%20in%20range(2%2C%20min(BC%2C%20T%20-%20i_tc0))%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_a00%20%3D%20tl.sum(tl.where((o_i%20%3D%3D%20i)%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%2C%20-b_A00%2C%200.0)%2C%200)%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_a00%20%3D%20tl.where(o_i%20%3C%20i%2C%20b_a00%2C%200.0)%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_a00%20%3D%20b_a00%20%2B%20tl.sum(b_a00%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20b_Ai00%2C%200)%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_Ai00%20%3D%20tl.where((o_i%20%3D%3D%20i)%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%2C%20b_a00%2C%20b_Ai00)%5Cnb_Ai00%20%2B%3D%20m_I%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E5%AF%B9%E8%A7%92%E5%AD%90%E5%9D%97%E5%89%8D%E4%BB%A3%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Fchunk_fwd.py%23L40-L328%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li>逆矩阵的严格下三角部分初始化为 <code>-b_A00</code>。第 0 行没有下三角元素，第 1 行的结果已由初始化给出，因此循环从索引 2 开始。<code>tl.sum(tl.where(...), 0)</code> 从寄存器矩阵中提取当前行；第二个 <code>tl.sum</code> 累积已求出的行对当前行的贡献；<code>tl.where</code> 将结果写回对应行，最后加上单位对角线 <code>m_I</code>。其余三个对角块执行相同操作</li>
<li><strong>合并相邻的 16×16 块。</strong> 以零基索引表示四行四列子块。<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-297%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7Brs%7D%22%7D"></card> 表示整体逆矩阵的第 (r,s) 个子块，不是非对角块单独求逆。三个紧邻对角线的子块分别为</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{10}=-\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{11}\mathbf A_{10}\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{00},\quad \mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{21}=-\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{22}\mathbf A_{21}\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{11},\quad \mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{32}=-\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{33}\mathbf A_{32}\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{22}.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-298%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B10%7D%3D-%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B11%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B10%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B00%7D%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B21%7D%3D-%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B22%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B21%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B11%7D%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B32%7D%3D-%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B33%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B32%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B22%7D.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-299%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b_Ai10%20%3D%20-tl.dot(%5Cn%20%20%20%20tl.dot(b_Ai11%2C%20b_A10%2C%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_Ai00%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION%2C%5Cn)%5Cnb_Ai21%20%3D%20-tl.dot(%5Cn%20%20%20%20tl.dot(b_Ai22%2C%20b_A21%2C%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_Ai11%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION%2C%5Cn)%5Cnb_Ai32%20%3D%20-tl.dot(%5Cn%20%20%20%20tl.dot(b_Ai33%2C%20b_A32%2C%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_Ai22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION%2C%5Cn)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E7%9B%B8%E9%82%BB%E5%AD%90%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Fchunk_fwd.py%23L40-L328%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li>每个结果由两个对角块的逆和一个原始非对角块相乘得到。上述三个子块之间没有依赖；完成后才能计算跨越更多子块的结果</li>
<li><strong>合并更远的非对角块。</strong> 第 (2,0)、(3,1) 个子块依赖相邻块结果，左下角第 (3,0) 个子块进一步依赖第 (2,0) 个结果</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{20}&amp;=-\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{22}
\left(\mathbf A_{20}\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{00}
+\mathbf A_{21}\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{10}\right),\\
\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{31}&amp;=-\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{33}
\left(\mathbf A_{31}\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{11}
+\mathbf A_{32}\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{21}\right),\\
\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{30}&amp;=-\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{33}
\left(\mathbf A_{30}\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{00}
+\mathbf A_{31}\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{10}
+\mathbf A_{32}\mathbf A^{\mathrm{inv}}_{20}\right).
\end{aligned}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-300%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B20%7D%26%3D-%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B22%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B00%7D%5Cn%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B21%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B10%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B31%7D%26%3D-%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B33%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B31%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B11%7D%5Cn%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B32%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B21%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B30%7D%26%3D-%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B33%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B30%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B00%7D%5Cn%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B31%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B10%7D%5Cn%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B32%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binv%7D%7D_%7B20%7D%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-301%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b_Ai20%20%3D%20-tl.dot(%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_Ai22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20tl.dot(b_A20%2C%20b_Ai00%2C%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2B%20tl.dot(b_A21%2C%20b_Ai10%2C%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION%2C%5Cn)%5Cnb_Ai31%20%3D%20-tl.dot(%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_Ai33%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20tl.dot(b_A31%2C%20b_Ai11%2C%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2B%20tl.dot(b_A32%2C%20b_Ai21%2C%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION%2C%5Cn)%5Cnb_Ai30%20%3D%20-tl.dot(%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_Ai33%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20tl.dot(b_A30%2C%20b_Ai00%2C%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2B%20tl.dot(b_A31%2C%20b_Ai10%2C%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2B%20tl.dot(b_A32%2C%20b_Ai20%2C%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20input_precision%3DSOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION%2C%5Cn)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%AA%E5%AD%90%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Fchunk_fwd.py%23L40-L328%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li>两级分块将逐行依赖限制在 16×16 对角块内部，再用 <code>tl.dot</code> 完成块间合并。四个对角块与六个非对角块共同构成完整的 64×64 下三角逆矩阵。默认融合路径直接复用 KKT 的寄存器结果，省去严格下三角系数的中间写回和重新加载</li>
<li>通用 <code>solve_tril</code> 在环境支持时使用 TMA descriptor，<code>FLA_TRIL_PRECISION</code> 默认 <code>ieee</code>；支持 TMA 时，autotune 在 <code>ieee</code> 与用户指定精度之间选择。GDN 默认融合 kernel 使用普通指针加载，块合并在支持 TF32 时使用 <code>tf32</code>，否则使用 <code>ieee</code>。二者使用同一分块求解原理，但访存与精度配置不同</li>
<li><strong>逆矩阵写回。</strong> 融合路径先以 <code>torch.zeros(B, T, HV, BT, dtype=k.dtype)</code> 分配 A，只覆盖十个下三角子块，上三角保持零。第 i 行的首地址为 <code>(bos * HV + head) * BT + i * HV * BT</code>，行内列号是 chunk 内位置；因此逻辑上的 <code>[BT, BT]</code> 矩阵在全局缓冲区中按 token、head 交错存放。16/32-token 分步路径先把 KKT 写为 FP32，再由 <code>solve_tril(..., output_dtype=k.dtype)</code> 输出逆矩阵，两条路径最终都以 K 的 dtype 保存 A</li>
<li>对三角系统求逆的正确性不依赖 beta 或 gate 的具体值：严格下三角矩阵满足 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-302%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%5E%7BBT%7D%3D0%22%7D"></card>，所以 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-303%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A)%5E%7B-1%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Br%3D0%7D%5E%7BBT-1%7D(-%5C%5Cmathbf%20A)%5Er%22%7D"></card>。实现使用前代和块矩阵乘法求同一个有限展开，避免显式计算各次幂。FP32 累加、矩阵乘法精度以及写回 dtype 仍会影响有限精度误差</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="wu共享同一个三角变换">W/U：共享同一个三角变换</h2>
<ul>
<li><code>fla/ops/gated_delta_rule/wy_fast.py</code> 的 <code>recompute_w_u_fwd_kernel</code> 使用网格 <code>(NT, B * HV)</code>，每个 program 处理一个 chunk、一个 value head。读取求解后的逆矩阵 <code>b_A</code>，分别对 V、K 执行矩阵乘法，生成 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-304%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card> 与 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-305%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card></li>
<li><strong>计算 value 的 UT 变换。</strong> 由于 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-306%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20T_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card> 的定义已经包含 beta，此处不再额外写一次 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-307%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%22%7D"></card></li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\widetilde{\mathbf U}_{[t]}
=\mathbf T_{[t]}\mathbf V_{[t]}
=(\mathbf I+\mathbf A_{[t]})^{-1}
\left(\operatorname{diag}(\beta_{[t]})\mathbf V_{[t]}\right).
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-308%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20T_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5E%7B-1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-309%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22o_t%20%3D%20i_t%20*%20BT%20%2B%20tl.arange(0%2C%20BT)%5Cno_A%20%3D%20tl.arange(0%2C%20BT)%5Cnm_t%20%3D%20o_t%20%3C%20T%5Cnm_A%20%3D%20m_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20(o_A%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%20%3C%20BT)%5Cnp_b%20%3D%20beta%20%2B%20bos%20*%20HV%20%2B%20i_h%20%2B%20o_t%20*%20HV%5Cnb_b%20%3D%20tl.load(p_b%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cn%5Cnp_A%20%3D%20A%20%2B%20(bos%20*%20HV%20%2B%20i_h)%20*%20BT%20%2B%20o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20(HV%20*%20BT)%20%2B%20o_A%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cnb_A%20%3D%20tl.load(p_A%2C%20mask%3Dm_A%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cn%5Cnfor%20i_v%20in%20range(tl.cdiv(V%2C%20BV))%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20o_v%20%3D%20i_v%20*%20BV%20%2B%20tl.arange(0%2C%20BV)%5Cn%20%20%20%20m_v%20%3D%20m_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20(o_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%20%3C%20V)%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_v%20%3D%20v%20%2B%20(bos%20*%20HV%20%2B%20i_h)%20*%20V%20%2B%20o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20(HV%20*%20V)%20%2B%20o_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_u%20%3D%20u%20%2B%20(bos%20*%20HV%20%2B%20i_h)%20*%20V%20%2B%20o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20(HV%20*%20V)%20%2B%20o_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_v%20%3D%20tl.load(p_v%2C%20mask%3Dm_v%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_vb%20%3D%20(b_v%20*%20b_b%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D).to(b_v.dtype)%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_u%20%3D%20tl.dot(b_A%2C%20b_vb%2C%20allow_tf32%3DFalse)%5Cn%20%20%20%20tl.store(p_u%2C%20b_u.to(p_u.dtype.element_ty)%2C%20mask%3Dm_v)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%8F%98%E6%8D%A2%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%20V%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Fwy_fast.py%23L39-L102%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><code>b_b</code> 为逐 token 的 beta，<code>b_A</code> 为整个 chunk 的逆矩阵。V 维按 <code>BV</code> 划分：先通过 <code>b_v * b_b[:, None]</code> 按行缩放 V，再用 <code>tl.dot(b_A, b_vb)</code> 应用三角逆变换。计算结果按 <code>[B, T, HV, V]</code> 写入 <code>u</code>；此时尚未扣除块入口状态的预测</li>
<li><strong>计算衰减后的 W。</strong> 入口状态传播到位置 r 时需要乘 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-310%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card>，因此 K 的右端项还需按累计衰减缩放</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}_{[t]}
=\mathbf T_{[t]}\operatorname{diag}(\gamma_{[t]})\mathbf K_{[t]}
=(\mathbf I+\mathbf A_{[t]})^{-1}
\left(\operatorname{diag}(\beta_{[t]})
\operatorname{diag}(\gamma_{[t]})\mathbf K_{[t]}\right).
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-311%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20T_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5E%7B-1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-312%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22if%20USE_G%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_g%20%3D%20g%20%2B%20(bos%20*%20HV%20%2B%20i_h)%20%2B%20o_t%20*%20HV%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_g%20%3D%20exp2(tl.load(p_g%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%2C%20other%3D0.0))%5Cn%5Cnfor%20i_k%20in%20range(tl.cdiv(K%2C%20BK))%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20o_k%20%3D%20i_k%20*%20BK%20%2B%20tl.arange(0%2C%20BK)%5Cn%20%20%20%20m_k%20%3D%20m_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20(o_k%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%20%3C%20K)%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_k%20%3D%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2B%20(bos%20*%20H%20%2B%20i_h%20%2F%2F%20(HV%20%2F%2F%20H))%20*%20K%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2B%20o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20(H%20*%20K)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2B%20o_k%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_w%20%3D%20w%20%2B%20(bos%20*%20HV%20%2B%20i_h)%20*%20K%20%2B%20o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20(HV%20*%20K)%20%2B%20o_k%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_k%20%3D%20tl.load(p_k%2C%20mask%3Dm_k%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_kb%20%3D%20b_k%20*%20b_b%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20USE_G%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_kb%20*%3D%20b_g%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_w%20%3D%20tl.dot(b_A%2C%20b_kb.to(b_k.dtype))%5Cn%20%20%20%20tl.store(p_w%2C%20b_w.to(p_w.dtype.element_ty)%2C%20mask%3Dm_k)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E8%A1%B0%E5%87%8F%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%20W%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Fwy_fast.py%23L39-L102%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><code>exp2</code> 将累计 gate 还原为 gamma；<code>b_kb</code> 依次乘 beta 与 gamma，然后与同一份 <code>b_A</code> 相乘。衰减乘在右端 K 上，不能任意移到 <code>tl.dot</code> 之后。这里得到的 W 与论文 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-313%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20w%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card> 一致，其中无箭头 W 使用无衰减的三角系统</li>
<li>K 的 head 通过 <code>i_h // (HV // H)</code> 映射到共享的 key head，W 则为每个 value head 独立保存。U 不需要额外乘 gamma：它的块内衰减已经包含在三角系数 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-314%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card> 中；W 的额外 gamma 用于入口状态向块内各位置的传播</li>
<li><strong>与无衰减 WY 系数的对应。</strong> 令 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-315%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_0%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BstrictLower%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5E%5C%5Ctop)%22%7D"></card>，在实数数学中有 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-316%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20D%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_0%5C%5Cmathbf%20D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%7D"></card>。因此带衰减的三角逆与无衰减的三角逆满足相似变换</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}=(\mathbf I+\mathbf A)^{-1}\mathbf B_\beta\mathbf D\mathbf K=\mathbf D(\mathbf I+\mathbf A_0)^{-1}\mathbf B_\beta\mathbf K=\mathbf D\mathbf W_0.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-317%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A)%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Cmathbf%20D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A_0)%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20D%5C%5Cmathbf%20W_0.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>使用同一个带衰减的逆矩阵时，K 的 gamma 缩放不能移到输出端。实现也不显式构造 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-318%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%7D"></card>，而是用累计对数之差计算区间衰减</li>
<li><code>recompute_w_u_fwd</code> 的 K/V 分片尺寸均为 64。U 的 <code>tl.dot</code> 显式设置 <code>allow_tf32=False</code>，W 使用该调用的默认精度；中间乘积与累加按对应 Triton dtype 规则执行，最终 <code>w</code> 使用 K 的 dtype、<code>u</code> 使用 V 的 dtype。源码中的 FP32 累加不能理解为所有中间量都以 FP32 保存</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="块间状态残差校正与衰减写入">块间状态：残差校正与衰减写入</h2>
<ul>
<li><code>fla/ops/common/chunk_delta_h.py</code> 的 <code>chunk_gated_delta_rule_fwd_kernel_h_blockdim64</code> 实现论文的块间递推</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf S_{[t+1]}=\overrightarrow{\mathbf S}_{[t]}+
\left(\widetilde{\mathbf U}_{[t]}-
\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}_{[t]}\mathbf S_{[t]}^\top\right)^\top
\overrightarrow{\mathbf K}_{[t]}.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-319%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%2B1%5D%7D%3D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20S%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D-%5Cn%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright)%5E%5C%5Ctop%5Cn%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>网格为 <code>(ceil(V / BV), N * HV)</code>，每个 program 处理一条序列、一个 value head 和一片 value 通道，并沿 chunk 顺序递推。下面展开 scalar gate、K=128 的源码分支：<code>b_h1</code>、<code>b_h2</code> 分别保存 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-320%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card> 的两个 <code>[64, BV]</code> 片段，初值从 <code>h0</code> 加载，无初始状态时置零。各基址已定位到当前序列与 head；<code>o_k1</code>、<code>o_k2</code> 分别覆盖 K 维的 0–63、64–127 通道。两段代码属于同一个 <code>for i_t in range(NT)</code> 循环</li>
<li><strong>保存入口状态并计算写入残差。</strong> W 乘入口状态得到此前历史在当前块的预测，从 U 中扣除后即为实际残差</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf V_{\mathrm{new},[t]}=
\widetilde{\mathbf U}_{[t]}-
\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}_{[t]}\mathbf S_{[t]}^\top.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-321%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnew%7D%2C%5Bt%5D%7D%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D-%5Cn%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-322%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22for%20i_t%20in%20range(NT)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20i_t_int64%20%3D%20i_t.to(tl.int64)%5Cn%20%20%20%20o_t%20%3D%20i_t%20*%20BT%20%2B%20tl.arange(0%2C%20BT)%5Cn%20%20%20%20m_t%20%3D%20o_t%20%3C%20T%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_h1%20%3D%20h%20%2B%20i_t_int64%20*%20HV%20*%20K%20*%20V%20%2B%20o_k1%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20V%20%2B%20o_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20m_h1%20%3D%20m_k1%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20tl.store(p_h1%2C%20b_h1.to(p_h1.dtype.element_ty)%2C%20mask%3Dm_h1)%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_h2%20%3D%20h%20%2B%20i_t_int64%20*%20HV%20*%20K%20*%20V%20%2B%20o_k2%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20V%20%2B%20o_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20m_h2%20%3D%20m_k2%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20tl.store(p_h2%2C%20b_h2.to(p_h2.dtype.element_ty)%2C%20mask%3Dm_h2)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_w%20%3D%20w%20%2B%20o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20(HV%20*%20K)%20%2B%20o_k1%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_w%20%3D%20tl.load(p_w%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_k1%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_v%20%3D%20tl.dot(b_w%2C%20b_h1.to(b_w.dtype))%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_w%20%3D%20w%20%2B%20o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20(HV%20*%20K)%20%2B%20o_k2%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_w%20%3D%20tl.load(p_w%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_k2%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_v%20%2B%3D%20tl.dot(b_w%2C%20b_h2.to(b_w.dtype))%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_v%20%3D%20v%20%2B%20o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20(HV%20*%20V)%20%2B%20o_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_v%20%3D%20tl.load(p_v%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%2C%20other%3D0.0)%20-%20b_v%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_v%20%3D%20v_new%20%2B%20o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20(HV%20*%20V)%20%2B%20o_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20tl.store(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20p_v%2C%20b_v.to(p_v.dtype.element_ty)%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%9D%97%E5%86%85%E6%AE%8B%E5%B7%AE%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fcommon%2Fchunk_delta_h.py%23L50-L338%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li>开头两次 <code>tl.store</code> 保存当前块的入口状态，供输出 kernel 读取。两个 <code>tl.dot</code> 分别收缩 W 与状态的两片 K 通道，结果相加后才构成完整的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-323%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card>。参数 <code>v</code> 在调用时传入的是 U，因此 <code>tl.load(p_v) - b_v</code> 正好得到上述残差，写入 <code>v_new</code></li>
<li><strong>衰减至块末并累积状态。</strong> 对残差的第 r 行乘 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-324%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5EC%2F%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card>，等价于将相同衰减乘入论文中的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-325%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card>。转置后的状态更新为</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf S_{[t+1]}^\top
=\gamma_{[t]}^C\mathbf S_{[t]}^\top+
\mathbf K_{[t]}^\top
\operatorname{diag}\!\left(\frac{\gamma_{[t]}^C}{\gamma_{[t]}}\right)
\left(\widetilde{\mathbf U}_{[t]}-
\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}_{[t]}\mathbf S_{[t]}^\top\right).
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-326%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%2B1%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5EC%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5EC%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D-%5Cn%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-327%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22last_idx%20%3D%20min((i_t%20%2B%201)%20*%20BT%2C%20T)%20-%201%5Cnb_g_last%20%3D%20tl.load(g%20%2B%20(bos%20*%20HV%20%2B%20last_idx%20*%20HV%20%2B%20i_h).to(tl.int64)).to(%5Cn%20%20%20%20tl.float32%5Cn)%5Cnp_g%20%3D%20g%20%2B%20(bos%20*%20HV%20%2B%20i_h).to(tl.int64)%20%2B%20o_t%20*%20HV%5Cnb_g%20%3D%20tl.load(p_g%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%2C%20other%3D0.0).to(tl.float32)%5Cnb_v%20%3D%20b_v%20*%20tl.where(m_t%2C%20exp2(b_g_last%20-%20b_g)%2C%200)%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%5Cnb_g_last%20%3D%20exp2(b_g_last)%5Cnb_h1%20*%3D%20b_g_last%5Cnb_h2%20*%3D%20b_g_last%5Cn%5Cnb_v%20%3D%20b_v.to(k.dtype.element_ty)%5Cn%5Cnp_k%20%3D%20k%20%2B%20o_k1%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%2B%20o_t%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%20*%20(H%20*%20K)%5Cnb_k%20%3D%20tl.load(p_k%2C%20mask%3Dm_k1%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_t%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cnb_h1%20%2B%3D%20tl.dot(b_k%2C%20b_v)%5Cnp_k%20%3D%20k%20%2B%20o_k2%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%2B%20o_t%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%20*%20(H%20*%20K)%5Cnb_k%20%3D%20tl.load(p_k%2C%20mask%3Dm_k2%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_t%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cnb_h2%20%2B%3D%20tl.dot(b_k%2C%20b_v)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E5%9D%97%E9%97%B4%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fcommon%2Fchunk_delta_h.py%23L50-L338%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><code>last_idx</code> 取当前 chunk 的最后一个有效 token；尾块不足 64 个 token 时，衰减终点随有效长度缩短。<code>exp2(b_g_last - b_g)</code> 对残差施加位置到块末的衰减，<code>exp2(b_g_last)</code> 则整体缩放入口状态。随后两次 <code>tl.dot(b_k, b_v)</code> 分别将同一份残差写入两片状态，组成下一块的入口状态</li>
<li><code>v_new</code> 必须在乘块末衰减之前保存，因为块内输出需要按每个 query 的位置计算区间衰减。状态寄存器在循环内持续更新；循环结束后，按 <code>STORE_FINAL_STATE</code> 写回最终状态 <code>ht</code>。packed 输入用 <code>cu_seqlens</code> 定位 token，用 <code>chunk_offsets</code> 定位块入口状态，各序列独立递推</li>
<li><strong>状态缓存的生命周期。</strong> <code>h</code> 保存每个 chunk 更新前的状态，<code>final_state</code> 只保存整条序列处理完后的状态；不能用块末状态代替同一块的入口状态，否则输出会重复计入当前 chunk 的写入。状态在 kernel 内以 FP32 寄存器累积，保存给输出 kernel 的 <code>h</code> 使用 K 的 dtype，最终 <code>ht</code> 使用 FP32；矩阵乘法前还会按操作数 dtype 转换寄存器片段</li>
<li>对 packed 输入，物理 batch 通常为 1，逻辑序列由 <code>cu_seqlens</code> 分开。<code>chunk_indices</code> 将全局 chunk 编号映射到 <code>(序列编号, 序列内 chunk 编号)</code>；<code>chunk_offsets</code> 是每条序列 chunk 数的前缀和，用于定位状态缓存。每条序列分别加载初态、重置累计门控并写回末态，不能让短序列的尾块与下一条序列合并成一个 chunk</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="块内输出历史项与局部项">块内输出：历史项与局部项</h2>
<ul>
<li><code>fla/ops/common/chunk_o.py</code> 的 <code>chunk_fwd_kernel_o</code> 读取块入口状态与 <code>v_new</code>，实现论文输出式中的两项。将局部项的区间衰减显式写出，并保留代码中的缩放 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-328%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s%3Dd_k%5E%7B-1%2F2%7D%22%7D"></card></li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf O_{[t]}=s\left[
\overleftarrow{\mathbf Q}_{[t]}\mathbf S_{[t]}^\top+
\left(\mathbf Q_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}^\top\odot\Gamma_{[t]}\right)
\left(\widetilde{\mathbf U}_{[t]}-
\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}_{[t]}\mathbf S_{[t]}^\top\right)
\right].
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-329%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20O_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3Ds%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D-%5Cn%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>网格为 <code>(ceil(V / BV), NT, B * HV)</code>。每个 program 处理一个 chunk、一个 value head 和一片 value 通道；各块入口状态已在上一阶段生成，因此此处可以按 chunk 并行。以下两段连续摘录 scalar gate 分支，指针基址已按当前序列、head 和 chunk 定位</li>
<li><strong>沿 K 维累计两个矩阵乘积。</strong> 两个 FP32 累加器分别保存尚未施加衰减的历史读出和块内 QK 权重</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathtt{b\_o}\ \longleftrightarrow\;
\mathbf Q_{[t]}\mathbf S_{[t]}^\top,
\qquad
\mathtt{b\_A}\ \longleftrightarrow\;
\mathbf Q_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}^\top.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-330%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathtt%7Bb%5C%5C_o%7D%5C%5C%20%5C%5Clongleftrightarrow%5C%5C%3B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathtt%7Bb%5C%5C_A%7D%5C%5C%20%5C%5Clongleftrightarrow%5C%5C%3B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-331%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b_o%20%3D%20tl.zeros(%5BBT%2C%20BV%5D%2C%20dtype%3Dtl.float32)%5Cnb_A%20%3D%20tl.zeros(%5BBT%2C%20BT%5D%2C%20dtype%3Dtl.float32)%5Cn%5Cno_t%20%3D%20i_t%20*%20BT%20%2B%20tl.arange(0%2C%20BT)%5Cnm_t%20%3D%20o_t%20%3C%20T%5Cno_v%20%3D%20i_v%20*%20BV%20%2B%20tl.arange(0%2C%20BV)%5Cnfor%20i_k%20in%20range(tl.cdiv(K%2C%20BK))%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20o_k%20%3D%20i_k%20*%20BK%20%2B%20tl.arange(0%2C%20BK)%5Cn%20%20%20%20m_k%20%3D%20o_k%20%3C%20K%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_q%20%3D%20q%20%2B%20o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20(H%20*%20K)%20%2B%20o_k%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_k%20%3D%20k%20%2B%20o_k%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%2B%20o_t%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%20*%20(H%20*%20K)%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_h%20%3D%20h%20%2B%20o_k%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20V%20%2B%20o_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20m_h%20%3D%20m_k%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20(o_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%20%3C%20V)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%5BBT%2C%20BK%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_q%20%3D%20tl.load(p_q%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_k%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%5BBK%2C%20BT%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_k%20%3D%20tl.load(p_k%2C%20mask%3Dm_k%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_t%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_h%20%3D%20tl.load(p_h%2C%20mask%3Dm_h%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%5BBT%2C%20BK%5D%20%40%20%5BBK%2C%20BV%5D%20-%3E%20%5BBT%2C%20BV%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_o%20%2B%3D%20tl.dot(b_q%2C%20b_h)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%5BBT%2C%20BK%5D%20%40%20%5BBK%2C%20BT%5D%20-%3E%20%5BBT%2C%20BT%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_A%20%2B%3D%20tl.dot(b_q%2C%20b_k)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E9%A1%B9%E4%B8%8E%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%E9%A1%B9%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fcommon%2Fchunk_o.py%23L43-L140%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li>Q 的片段为 <code>[BT, BK]</code>，K 按 <code>[BK, BT]</code> 读取，入口状态片段为 <code>[BK, BV]</code>。同一份 <code>b_q</code> 同时参与两个 <code>tl.dot</code>；沿 K 维累加后，分别得到 <code>[BT, BV]</code> 的历史项与 <code>[BT, BT]</code> 的局部权重。这里的 <code>b_A</code> 是 QK 权重，与三角求解中的 A 无关</li>
<li><strong>施加区间衰减、因果掩码并合成输出。</strong> 历史项的第 r 行乘 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-332%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card>，局部权重的第 (r,i) 项乘 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-333%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%2F%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%22%7D"></card> 并保留 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-334%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%5C%5Cle%20r%22%7D"></card>，随后与残差相乘</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathtt{b\_o}\leftarrow\overleftarrow{\mathbf Q}_{[t]}\mathbf S_{[t]}^\top,\qquad \mathtt{b\_A}\leftarrow\mathbf Q_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}^\top\odot\Gamma_{[t]},\qquad \mathbf O_{[t]}=s(\mathtt{b\_o}+\mathtt{b\_A}\mathbf V_{\mathrm{new},[t]}).
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-335%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathtt%7Bb%5C%5C_o%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathtt%7Bb%5C%5C_A%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%20O_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3Ds(%5C%5Cmathtt%7Bb%5C%5C_o%7D%2B%5C%5Cmathtt%7Bb%5C%5C_A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnew%7D%2C%5Bt%5D%7D).%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-336%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22g%20%2B%3D%20bos%20*%20HV%20%2B%20i_h%5Cnp_g%20%3D%20g%20%2B%20o_t%20*%20HV%5Cnb_g%20%3D%20tl.load(p_g%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cnb_o%20%3D%20b_o%20*%20exp2(b_g)%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%5Cnb_A%20%3D%20b_A%20*%20exp2(b_g%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20-%20b_g%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D)%5Cnm_A%20%3D%20(o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%3E%3D%20o_t%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D)%20%26%20(m_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_t)%5Cnb_A%20%3D%20tl.where(m_A%2C%20b_A%2C%200)%5Cn%5Cnp_v%20%3D%20v%20%2B%20o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20(HV%20*%20V)%20%2B%20o_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cnp_o%20%3D%20o%20%2B%20o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20(HV%20*%20V)%20%2B%20o_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%5Cnb_v%20%3D%20tl.load(p_v%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20(o_v%20%3C%20V)%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cn%23%20to%20fix%20mma%20-%3E%20mma%20layout%20conversion%5Cn%23%20already%20solved%20by%20triton%20v3.2%20or%20higher%5Cnb_o%20%3D%20b_o%20*%20scale%20%2B%20tl.dot(b_A.to(b_v.dtype)%2C%20b_v)%20*%20scale%5Cntl.store(%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_o%2C%20b_o.to(p_o.dtype.element_ty)%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20(o_v%20%3C%20V)%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%B0%E5%87%8F%E4%B8%8E%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fcommon%2Fchunk_o.py%23L43-L140%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><code>exp2(b_g)</code> 将历史读出衰减到各 query 位置；<code>exp2(b_g[:, None] - b_g[None, :])</code> 对应 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-337%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card> 的非零元素。这里的掩码使用 <code>&gt;=</code>，包含对角线，使当前 token 读到本步写入；KKT 的掩码使用 <code>&gt;</code>，只表示此前写入对当前残差的影响</li>
<li>参数 <code>v</code> 传入上一阶段保存的 <code>v_new</code>。最后一次 <code>tl.dot</code> 汇总块内残差，并与历史项相加、乘 <code>scale</code> 后写回输出。变长输入通过全局 chunk 编号 <code>i_tg</code> 读取入口状态，通过序列内 chunk 编号 <code>i_t</code> 读取 Q/K/V，二者不能混用</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="反向传播状态伴随与三角变换梯度">反向传播：状态伴随与三角变换梯度</h2>
<ul>
<li>输出计算与块末状态都依赖 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-338%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnew%7D%2C%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card>，因此残差梯度由两条路径相加</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\frac{\partial\mathcal L}{\partial\mathbf V_{\mathrm{new},[t]}}
=s\left(\mathbf Q_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}^\top\odot\Gamma_{[t]}\right)^\top
\frac{\partial\mathcal L}{\partial\mathbf O_{[t]}}
+\overrightarrow{\mathbf K}_{[t]}
\left(\frac{\partial\mathcal L}{\partial\mathbf S_{[t+1]}}\right)^\top.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-339%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Cmathcal%20L%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnew%7D%2C%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%5Cn%3Ds%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%5C%5Ctop%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Cmathcal%20L%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Cmathbf%20O_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%5Cn%2B%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Cmathcal%20L%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%2B1%5D%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%5C%5Ctop.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li><code>chunk_bwd_dv_local</code> 计算上式第一项；<code>chunk_gated_delta_rule_bwd_dhu</code> 加入后续状态贡献，并从后向前递推状态梯度。<code>chunk_bwd_dqkwg</code> 处理输出与状态更新对 Q/K/W 和 gate 的梯度；<code>prepare_wy_repr_bwd</code> 再通过三角变换将 W/U 梯度传回 K/V、beta 和 gate</li>
<li><strong>状态梯度的倒序递推。</strong> 省略块编号，令 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-340%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20H%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-341%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20H_%2B%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%2B1%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-342%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20E%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnew%7D%2C%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card>，并记 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-343%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20C%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cgamma_C%2F%5C%5Cgamma)%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-344%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20P%3Ds(%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%5C%5CGamma)%22%7D"></card>。对任意中间量 X，用 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-345%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20X%7D%3D%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Cmathcal%20L%2F%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Cmathbf%20X%22%7D"></card> 表示同形状梯度。前向是 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-346%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20E%3D%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D-%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20H%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-347%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20H_%2B%3D%5C%5Cgamma_C%5C%5Cmathbf%20H%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cmathbf%20C%5C%5Cmathbf%20E%22%7D"></card> 和 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-348%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20O%3Ds%5C%5Cmathbf%20D%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q%5C%5Cmathbf%20H%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20P%5C%5Cmathbf%20E%22%7D"></card>，逐项求导得到</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\overline{\mathbf E}=\mathbf P^\top\overline{\mathbf O}+\mathbf C\mathbf K\overline{\mathbf H}_+,\qquad \overline{\widetilde{\mathbf U}}=\overline{\mathbf E},\qquad \overline{\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}}=-\overline{\mathbf E}\mathbf H^\top.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-349%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20E%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20P%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20O%7D%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20C%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20H%7D_%2B%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20E%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D%7D%3D-%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20E%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20H%5E%5C%5Ctop.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\overline{\mathbf H}=\gamma_C\overline{\mathbf H}_++s\mathbf Q^\top\mathbf D\overline{\mathbf O}-\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}^\top\overline{\mathbf E}.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-350%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20H%7D%3D%5C%5Cgamma_C%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20H%7D_%2B%2Bs%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cmathbf%20D%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20O%7D-%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20E%7D.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>状态梯度的三项分别来自块末状态的整体衰减、当前块输出对历史的直接读取，以及残差中减去的历史预测。<code>chunk_bwd_dv_local</code> 先按 chunk 并行计算 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-351%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20P%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20O%7D%22%7D"></card>，<code>chunk_gated_delta_rule_bwd_dhu</code> 再从最后一块向前加入状态路径的贡献。最后一块从 <code>dht</code> 开始；未提供 <code>dht</code> 时为零，全部块处理完后得到 <code>dh0</code></li>
<li>在 <code>STATE_V_FIRST=False</code> 的源码分支中，K 的各片段先累加出 <code>b_dv</code>，再乘位置到块末的衰减。下面是残差梯度合并和第一片状态梯度的更新；其他 K 片段以同样方式累加</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-352%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b_dv%20*%3D%20tl.where(m_t%2C%20exp2(bg_last%20-%20b_g)%2C%200)%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%5Cnb_dv%20%2B%3D%20tl.load(p_dv%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%2C%20other%3D0.0)%5Cntl.store(%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_dv2%2C%20b_dv.to(p_dv.dtype.element_ty)%2C%20mask%3Dm_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn)%5Cnb_dh1%20*%3D%20bg_last_exp%5Cnb_q%20%3D%20b_q%20*%20b_g_exp%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cnb_dh1%20%2B%3D%20tl.dot(b_q.to(b_q.dtype)%2C%20b_do.to(b_q.dtype))%20*%20scale%20-%20tl.dot(%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_w%2C%20b_dv.to(b_w.dtype)%5Cn)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E4%BC%A0%E6%92%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fcommon%2Fchunk_delta_h.py%23L359-L671%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>Q/K 梯度的直接路径与间接路径。</strong> 暂时固定 U、W 和 gate，输出与状态更新直接产生的 Q/K 梯度为</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\overline{\mathbf Q}_{\mathrm{direct}}=s\mathbf D\overline{\mathbf O}\mathbf H^\top+s\left(\overline{\mathbf O}\mathbf E^\top\odot\Gamma\right)\mathbf K.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-353%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdirect%7D%7D%3Ds%5C%5Cmathbf%20D%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20O%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20H%5E%5C%5Ctop%2Bs%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20O%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20E%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%5C%5CGamma%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathbf%20K.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\overline{\mathbf K}_{\mathrm{direct}}=s\left(\overline{\mathbf O}\mathbf E^\top\odot\Gamma\right)^\top\mathbf Q+\mathbf C\mathbf E\overline{\mathbf H}_+^\top.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-354%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdirect%7D%7D%3Ds%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20O%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20E%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%5C%5CGamma%5C%5Cright)%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20C%5C%5Cmathbf%20E%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20H%7D_%2B%5E%5C%5Ctop.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li><code>chunk_bwd_dqkwg</code> 计算这些直接路径，并生成 W 和 gate 的梯度；K 还通过 Gram 矩阵以及 W 的右端项影响 U/W，这部分必须由 <code>prepare_wy_repr_bwd</code> 加回。因而 <code>dk.add_(dk2)</code> 是同一个输入经两条计算路径的梯度求和</li>
<li><strong>三角逆的梯度。</strong> 令 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-355%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20R%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A)%5E%7B-1%7D%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-356%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20X%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Cmathbf%20V%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-357%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20Y%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Cmathbf%20D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%22%7D"></card>，于是 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-358%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20R%5C%5Cmathbf%20X%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-359%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20R%5C%5Cmathbf%20Y%22%7D"></card>。先对两个矩阵乘法求导，再利用 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-360%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Cmathbf%20R%3D-%5C%5Cmathbf%20R(d%5C%5Cmathbf%20A)%5C%5Cmathbf%20R%22%7D"></card></li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\overline{\mathbf R}=\overline{\widetilde{\mathbf U}}\mathbf X^\top+\overline{\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}}\mathbf Y^\top,\qquad \overline{\mathbf X}=\mathbf R^\top\overline{\widetilde{\mathbf U}},\qquad \overline{\mathbf Y}=\mathbf R^\top\overline{\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}}.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-361%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20R%7D%3D%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20X%5E%5C%5Ctop%2B%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20Y%5E%5C%5Ctop%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20X%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20R%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20Y%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20R%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D%7D.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\overline{\mathbf A}=\operatorname{strictLower}\!\left(-\mathbf R^\top\overline{\mathbf R}\mathbf R^\top\right).
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-362%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BstrictLower%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(-%5C%5Cmathbf%20R%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20R%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20R%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li><code>prepare_wy_repr_bwd_kernel</code> 通过交换行列地址将代码变量 <code>b_A</code> 加载为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-363%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20R%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card>，先累加两个乘法对逆矩阵的梯度，再执行两次 <code>tl.dot</code>。单位对角线是常数，上三角恒为零；只有严格下三角系数需要回传。以下摘录中最后乘入的指数差把梯度继续传过 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-364%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CGamma%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card> 的逐元素衰减</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-365%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22m_A%20%3D%20(o_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%3E%20o_t%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D)%20%26%20(m_t%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20%26%20m_t)%5Cnb_dA%20%3D%20tl.where(m_A%2C%20b_dA%2C%200)%5Cnb_dA%20%3D%20tl.dot(b_dA.to(b_A.dtype)%2C%20b_A)%5Cnb_dA%20%3D%20tl.dot(b_A%2C%20b_dA.to(b_A.dtype))%5Cnb_dA%20*%3D%20exp2(b_g%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20-%20b_g%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D)%5Cnb_dA%20%3D%20tl.where(m_A%2C%20-b_dA%2C%200).to(k.dtype.element_ty)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E5%8F%8D%E4%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%E8%A7%92%E5%8F%98%E6%8D%A2%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Fwy_fast.py%23L119-L247%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>beta、原始 V 和 K 的梯度。</strong> 记 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-366%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20J%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-367%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20F%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%5C%5Cbeta(%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20A%7D%5C%5Codot%5C%5CGamma)%22%7D"></card>，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-368%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clangle%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Crangle%22%7D"></card> 表示同一行向量的内积。右端项与三角系数共同贡献</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\overline{\mathbf V}=\mathbf B_\beta\overline{\mathbf X},\qquad \overline{\mathbf K}_{\mathrm{WY}}=\mathbf D\mathbf B_\beta\overline{\mathbf Y}+(\mathbf F+\mathbf F^\top)\mathbf K.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-369%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20V%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20X%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BWY%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20D%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20Y%7D%2B(%5C%5Cmathbf%20F%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20F%5E%5C%5Ctop)%5C%5Cmathbf%20K.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\overline\beta_i=\langle\overline{\mathbf X}_i,\mathbf V_i\rangle+\gamma_i\langle\overline{\mathbf Y}_i,\mathbf K_i\rangle+\sum_{j&lt;i}\overline A_{ij}\Gamma_{ij}J_{ij}.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-370%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%5C%5Cbeta_i%3D%5C%5Clangle%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20X%7D_i%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_i%5C%5Crangle%2B%5C%5Cgamma_i%5C%5Clangle%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20Y%7D_i%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_i%5C%5Crangle%2B%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%3Ci%7D%5C%5Coverline%20A_%7Bij%7D%5C%5CGamma_%7Bij%7DJ_%7Bij%7D.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>K 同时出现在 Gram 矩阵的左右两侧，所以间接梯度含 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-371%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20F%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20F%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card>。<code>beta</code> 也同时出现在右端缩放和三角系数中，不能只对 <code>v * beta</code> 求导。共享 Q/K head 时，各 value head 先计算自己的贡献，再沿组内 head 维求和；源码最后的 <code>dk.view(B, T, H, HV // H, K).sum(3)</code> 恢复原始 K 的形状</li>
<li><strong>gate 梯度与最后一次反向前缀和。</strong> 令 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-372%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell_i%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%5C%5Cle%20i%7Dg_j%3D%5C%5Cln%5C%5Cgamma_i%22%7D"></card> 为自然对数累计 gate，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-373%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22Z_%7Bij%7D%3D%5C%5Coverline%20A_%7Bij%7DA_%7Bij%7D%22%7D"></card>。仅来自 WY 变换的累计 gate 梯度为</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\overline\ell_i^{\mathrm{WY}}=\langle\overline{\mathbf Y}_i,\mathbf Y_i\rangle+\sum_j Z_{ij}-\sum_j Z_{ji},\qquad \frac{\partial\mathcal L}{\partial g_i}=\sum_{r\ge i}\frac{\partial\mathcal L}{\partial\ell_r}.
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-374%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%5C%5Cell_i%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BWY%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Clangle%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20Y%7D_i%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20Y_i%5C%5Crangle%2B%5C%5Csum_j%20Z_%7Bij%7D-%5C%5Csum_j%20Z_%7Bji%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Cmathcal%20L%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20g_i%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Br%5C%5Cge%20i%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Cmathcal%20L%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Cell_r%7D.%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>行和减列和来自 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-375%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CGamma_%7Bij%7D%3De%5E%7B%5C%5Cell_i-%5C%5Cell_j%7D%22%7D"></card>：行位置贡献正号、列位置贡献负号。<code>chunk_bwd_dqkwg</code> 另行计算输出及状态传播中的 gate 梯度，两路相加后再做 chunk 内的后缀和。源码虽然前向存储 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-376%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidehat%20g%3D%5C%5Cell%2F%5C%5Cln2%22%7D"></card> 并调用 <code>exp2</code>，手写 backward 返回的是相对于 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-377%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell%22%7D"></card> 的梯度，因此末尾的 <code>chunk_local_cumsum(..., reverse=True)</code> 不再乘 <code>RCP_LN2</code>；这与直接对 <code>exp2</code> 自动求导时出现的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-378%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cln2%22%7D"></card> 因子相互抵消</li>
<li>前向保存归一化后的 Q/K、原始 V、累计 gate、beta、三角逆 A、初态和序列索引，反向重算 W/U、块入口状态和 <code>v_new</code>。若启用 kernel 内 Q/K 归一化，最外层还要调用 <code>l2norm_bwd</code>；融合 beta sigmoid 时再经过 <code>fused_beta_sigmoid_bwd</code>，融合衰减门时则由 <code>gdn_gate_bwd</code> 回传到 gate 输入、<code>A_log</code> 和 <code>dt_bias</code></li>
<li><strong>重算 W/U。</strong> 反向入口用保存的 K、V、beta、A 和累计 gate 重建 W/U；上下文并行时，同时展开初始状态供后续重计算使用。下面各段接续同一个反向函数</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-379%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20chunk_gated_delta_rule_bwd(%5Cn%20%20%20%20q%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20k%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20v%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20g%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20beta%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20A%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20scale%3A%20float%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20initial_state%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20do%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20dht%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20state_v_first%3A%20bool%20%3D%20False%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3A%20torch.LongTensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20cp_context%3A%20FLACPContext%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%3A%20torch.LongTensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20use_gate_in_kernel%3A%20bool%20%3D%20False%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20g_input%3A%20torch.Tensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20A_log%3A%20torch.Tensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20dt_bias%3A%20torch.Tensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20chunk_size%3A%20int%20%3D%2064%2C%5Cn)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20w%2C%20u%20%3D%20recompute_w_u_fwd(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k%3Dk%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20v%3Dv%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20beta%3Dbeta%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20A%3DA%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dcu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%3Dchunk_indices%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20cp_context%20is%20not%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20initial_state%20%3D%20expand_h0(initial_state%2C%20context%3Dcp_context)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%20Chunk%20%E5%8F%8D%E5%90%91%E4%BC%A0%E6%92%AD%20%C2%B7%201%2F5%20%E9%87%8D%E7%AE%97%20W%2FU%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Fchunk.py%23L126-L250%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>重算状态与局部 V 梯度。</strong> 重建各块入口状态 h 和残差 <code>v_new</code>，再由输出梯度计算块内的局部 V 梯度，作为状态反传的输入</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-380%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20h%2C%20v_new%2C%20_%20%3D%20chunk_gated_delta_rule_fwd_h(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k%3Dk%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20w%3Dw%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20u%3Du%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20initial_state%3Dinitial_state%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20output_final_state%3DFalse%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dcu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%3Dchunk_indices%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20state_v_first%3Dstate_v_first%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_size%3Dchunk_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20dv%20%3D%20chunk_bwd_dv_local(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20q%3Dq%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k%3Dk%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20do%3Ddo%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20scale%3Dscale%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dcu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%3Dchunk_indices%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_size%3Dchunk_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%20Chunk%20%E5%8F%8D%E5%90%91%E4%BC%A0%E6%92%AD%20%C2%B7%202%2F5%20%E9%87%8D%E7%AE%97%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%8E%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%20V%20%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Fchunk.py%23L126-L250%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>沿状态链反向传播。</strong> 上下文并行分支先处理边界梯度；随后状态反向 kernel 计算各块状态梯度、初态梯度，并把状态传播的贡献合入 V 梯度</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-381%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20if%20cp_context%20is%20not%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20dht%2C%20initial_state%20%3D%20chunk_gated_delta_rule_bwd_dhu_pre_process(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20q%3Dq%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k%3Dk%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20w%3Dw%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20do%3Ddo%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20dv%3Ddv%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20scale%3Dscale%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dcu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20dht%3Ddht%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20initial_state%3Dinitial_state%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20context%3Dcp_context%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20state_v_first%3Dstate_v_first%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_size%3Dchunk_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20dh%2C%20dh0%2C%20dv%20%3D%20chunk_gated_delta_rule_bwd_dhu(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20q%3Dq%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k%3Dk%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20w%3Dw%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20h0%3Dinitial_state%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20dht%3Ddht%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20do%3Ddo%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20dv%3Ddv%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20scale%3Dscale%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dcu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%3Dchunk_indices%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20state_v_first%3Dstate_v_first%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_size%3Dchunk_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%20Chunk%20%E5%8F%8D%E5%90%91%E4%BC%A0%E6%92%AD%20%C2%B7%203%2F5%20%E6%B2%BF%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E9%93%BE%E5%8F%8D%E5%90%91%E4%BC%A0%E6%92%AD%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Fchunk.py%23L126-L250%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>Q/K 与三角变换梯度。</strong> <code>chunk_bwd_dqkwg()</code> 回传读出和状态计算中的 Q/K/W/g 梯度，<code>prepare_wy_repr_bwd()</code> 再将 W/U 的梯度传回 K、V、beta 与 gate</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-382%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20dq%2C%20dk%2C%20dw%2C%20dg%20%3D%20chunk_bwd_dqkwg(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20q%3Dq%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k%3Dk%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20v%3Dv_new%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20w%3Dw%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20h%3Dh%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20dv%3Ddv%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20do%3Ddo%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20dh%3Ddh%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20scale%3Dscale%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dcu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%3Dchunk_indices%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20state_v_first%3Dstate_v_first%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_size%3Dchunk_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20dk2%2C%20dv%2C%20db%2C%20dg2%20%3D%20prepare_wy_repr_bwd(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k%3Dk%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20v%3Dv%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20beta%3Dbeta%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20A%3DA%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20dw%3Ddw%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20du%3Ddv%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dcu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%3Dchunk_indices%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%20Chunk%20%E5%8F%8D%E5%90%91%E4%BC%A0%E6%92%AD%20%C2%B7%204%2F5%20Q%2FK%20%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%89%E8%A7%92%E5%8F%98%E6%8D%A2%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Fchunk.py%23L126-L250%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>合并 Gate 梯度。</strong> 两条路径的 K 和 gate 梯度分别相加。累计 gate 的梯度通过 chunk 内后缀和回到逐 token 输入；若启用融合 gate，还继续回传到 <code>A_log</code> 和 <code>dt_bias</code></li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-383%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20dk.add_(dk2)%5Cn%20%20%20%20dg.add_(dg2)%5Cn%20%20%20%20dg%20%3D%20chunk_local_cumsum(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_size%3Dchunk_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20reverse%3DTrue%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dcu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20chunk_indices%3Dchunk_indices%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20dA_log%2C%20ddt_bias%20%3D%20(None%2C%20None)%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20use_gate_in_kernel%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20dg%2C%20dA_log%2C%20ddt_bias%20%3D%20gdn_gate_bwd(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg_input%2C%20A_log%3DA_log%2C%20dt_bias%3Ddt_bias%2C%20dyg%3Ddg%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20(dq%2C%20dk%2C%20dv%2C%20db%2C%20dg%2C%20dh0%2C%20dA_log%2C%20ddt_bias)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%20Chunk%20%E5%8F%8D%E5%90%91%E4%BC%A0%E6%92%AD%20%C2%B7%205%2F5%20%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%20Gate%20%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Fchunk.py%23L126-L250%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>并行化的代价。</strong> 对单个 value head，块内 KKT 与三角变换的主要矩阵乘法开销随 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-384%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%5C%5C%2CBT%5C%5C%2C(d_k%2Bd_v)%22%7D"></card> 增长，状态递推与读出随 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-385%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%5C%5C%2Cd_kd_v%22%7D"></card> 增长；固定 <code>BT</code> 后均随序列长度线性增长。显式三角求逆的分块计算还约有 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-386%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(T%2FBT)%5C%5C%2CBT%5E3%22%7D"></card> 的算术开销，<code>BT=64</code> 时是固定尺寸的块内工作。不同 chunk 的三角系统可并行求解，同一序列的状态仍顺序传递</li>
<li>A 占用约 <code>B * T * HV * BT</code> 个元素，入口状态缓存 <code>h</code> 占用约 <code>B * ceil(T / BT) * HV * K * V</code> 个元素。重算策略减少需要跨前向、反向长期保留的 W/U、h 和残差，但反向计算时仍要重新分配这些临时量；chunk 大小同时影响并行粒度、三角求解成本和状态缓存大小</li>
</ul>
</section><section class="lake-revised-section">
<h1 id="recurrent-算法代码解析">Recurrent 算法代码解析</h1>
<h2 id="状态分块与并行网格">状态分块与并行网格</h2>
<ul>
<li>Recurrent kernel 将每个序列、每个 value head 的状态沿 value 维划分。对于 scalar gate 分支，线程块尺寸与输出状态缓冲区为</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
B_K&amp;=2^{\lceil\log_2 d_k\rceil},\qquad
B_V=\min\!\left(8,2^{\lceil\log_2 d_v\rceil}\right),\\
N_V&amp;=\left\lceil d_v/B_V\right\rceil,\qquad
\mathrm{grid}=(N_V,NH_V),\\
\mathcal H_{\mathrm{final}}&amp;\in\mathbb R^{N\times H_V\times d_k\times d_v}.
\end{aligned}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-387%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5CnB_K%26%3D2%5E%7B%5C%5Clceil%5C%5Clog_2%20d_k%5C%5Crceil%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5CnB_V%3D%5C%5Cmin%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(8%2C2%5E%7B%5C%5Clceil%5C%5Clog_2%20d_v%5C%5Crceil%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5CnN_V%26%3D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clceil%20d_v%2FB_V%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crceil%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bgrid%7D%3D(N_V%2CNH_V)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%20H_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bfinal%7D%7D%26%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%20R%5E%7BN%5C%5Ctimes%20H_V%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>每个 program 维护一个 <code>[BK, BV]</code> 状态片段，并沿时间维串行更新。不同 value 片段可以独立推进，因为每个片段只需要完整 key 向量和对应的 value 子向量。较小的 BV 限制单个 program 的状态寄存器用量；最终状态使用 FP32 保存，供下一次调用接续</li>
<li><strong>分配状态与并行网格。</strong> 启动函数计算序列数和 head 数，将 K 维补到 2 的幂，并沿 V 维切片。需要返回末态时分配 FP32 缓冲区，网格覆盖所有序列、head 和 value 分片</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-388%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20fused_recurrent_gated_delta_rule_fwd(%5Cn%20%20%20%20q%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20k%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20v%3A%20torch.Tensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20g%3A%20torch.Tensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20gk%3A%20torch.Tensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20gv%3A%20torch.Tensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20beta%3A%20torch.Tensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20A_log%3A%20torch.Tensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20dt_bias%3A%20torch.Tensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20scale%3A%20float%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20initial_state%3A%20torch.Tensor%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20output_final_state%3A%20bool%20%3D%20False%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20use_qk_l2norm_in_kernel%3A%20bool%20%3D%20False%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20use_beta_sigmoid_in_kernel%3A%20bool%20%3D%20False%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20allow_neg_eigval%3A%20bool%20%3D%20False%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20state_v_first%3A%20bool%20%3D%20False%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3A%20torch.LongTensor%20%7C%20None%20%3D%20None%2C%5Cn)%20-%3E%20tuple%5Btorch.Tensor%2C%20torch.Tensor%5D%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20B%2C%20T%2C%20H%2C%20K%2C%20V%20%3D%20(*k.shape%2C%20v.shape%5B-1%5D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20HV%20%3D%20v.shape%5B2%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20N%20%3D%20B%20if%20cu_seqlens%20is%20None%20else%20len(cu_seqlens)%20-%201%5Cn%20%20%20%20BK%20%3D%20triton.next_power_of_2(K)%5Cn%20%20%20%20BV%20%3D%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20min(8%2C%20triton.next_power_of_2(V))%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20gv%20is%20None%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20else%20triton.next_power_of_2(V)%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20NV%20%3D%20triton.cdiv(V%2C%20BV)%5Cn%20%20%20%20o%20%3D%20torch.empty_like(v)%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20output_final_state%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20state_v_first%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20final_state%20%3D%20q.new_empty(N%2C%20HV%2C%20V%2C%20K%2C%20dtype%3Dtorch.float32)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20final_state%20%3D%20q.new_empty(N%2C%20HV%2C%20K%2C%20V%2C%20dtype%3Dtorch.float32)%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20final_state%20%3D%20None%5Cn%20%20%20%20grid%20%3D%20(NV%2C%20N%20*%20HV)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%20Recurrent%20%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%20%C2%B7%201%2F2%20%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%8E%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E7%BD%91%E6%A0%BC%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Ffused_recurrent.py%23L182-L248%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>启动 Recurrent Kernel。</strong> 将输入、初态、末态缓冲区和块尺寸交给 Triton kernel；归一化、beta 激活与状态布局通过编译期选项选择，调用结束后返回输出与末态</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-389%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20fused_recurrent_gated_delta_rule_fwd_kernel%5Bgrid%5D(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20q%3Dq%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k%3Dk%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20v%3Dv%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g%3Dg%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20gk%3Dgk%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20gv%3Dgv%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20beta%3Dbeta%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20A_log%3DA_log%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20dt_bias%3Ddt_bias%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20o%3Do%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20h0%3Dinitial_state%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20ht%3Dfinal_state%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cu_seqlens%3Dcu_seqlens%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20scale%3Dscale%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20T%3DT%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20H%3DH%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20HV%3DHV%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20K%3DK%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20V%3DV%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20BK%3DBK%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20BV%3DBV%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20IS_BETA_HEADWISE%3Dbeta.ndim%20!%3D%20v.ndim%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20USE_QK_L2NORM_IN_KERNEL%3Duse_qk_l2norm_in_kernel%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20APPLY_BETA_SIGMOID%3Duse_beta_sigmoid_in_kernel%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20ALLOW_NEG_EIGVAL%3Dallow_neg_eigval%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20STATE_V_FIRST%3Dstate_v_first%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20num_warps%3D1%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20num_stages%3D3%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20(o%2C%20final_state)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%20Recurrent%20%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%20%C2%B7%202%2F2%20%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%20Recurrent%20Kernel%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Ffused_recurrent.py%23L182-L248%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li>这里 N 为序列数，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-390%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22H_V%22%7D"></card> 为 value head 数。Q/K head 通过 <code>i_hv // (HV // H)</code> 映射，同一组 value head 共享 Q/K 输入，但各自维护独立的状态。prefill 写出的 chunk 末态与此处初始状态使用同一种缓冲区排列，二者之间不需要重新组织数学状态</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="逐-token-更新衰减残差与读出">逐 Token 更新：衰减、残差与读出</h2>
<ul>
<li>以代码中的状态矩阵 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-391%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22H_t%3DS_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card> 表示递推。包括 Q/K 归一化在内，一步更新由以下算式组成</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
q_t&amp;\leftarrow q_t/\sqrt{\|q_t\|_2^2+\varepsilon},\qquad
k_t\leftarrow k_t/\sqrt{\|k_t\|_2^2+\varepsilon},\\
\bar H_t&amp;=\exp(g_t)H_{t-1},\\
e_t&amp;=\beta_t\left(v_t-\bar H_t^\top k_t\right),\\
H_t&amp;=\bar H_t+k_te_t^\top,\\
o_t&amp;=sH_t^\top q_t.
\end{aligned}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-392%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cnq_t%26%5C%5Cleftarrow%20q_t%2F%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5C%7Cq_t%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cnk_t%5C%5Cleftarrow%20k_t%2F%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5C%7Ck_t%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cbar%20H_t%26%3D%5C%5Cexp(g_t)H_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cne_t%26%3D%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cleft(v_t-%5C%5Cbar%20H_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%20k_t%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5CnH_t%26%3D%5C%5Cbar%20H_t%2Bk_te_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cno_t%26%3DsH_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%20q_t.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>对 K 维的归约实现 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-393%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%20H_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%20k_t%22%7D"></card>，读出衰减后的旧 value；外积 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-394%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22k_te_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card> 将残差写入当前 key 方向；最后的归约实现状态对 query 的读出。完整 key 维包含在每个 program 内，因此这些归约不需要跨 program 通信</li>
<li><strong>初始化寄存器状态。</strong> 根据 <code>STATE_V_FIRST</code> 选择状态矩阵的两个维度顺序；有初态时加载对应片段，否则从 FP32 零状态开始</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-395%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22if%20STATE_V_FIRST%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_h%20%3D%20tl.zeros(%5BBV%2C%20BK%5D%2C%20dtype%3Dtl.float32)%5Cnelse%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_h%20%3D%20tl.zeros(%5BBK%2C%20BV%5D%2C%20dtype%3Dtl.float32)%5Cnif%20USE_INITIAL_STATE%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20STATE_V_FIRST%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20p_h0%20%3D%20h0%20%2B%20i_nh%20*%20K%20*%20V%20%2B%20o_v%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20K%20%2B%20o_k%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20p_h0%20%3D%20h0%20%2B%20i_nh%20*%20K%20*%20V%20%2B%20o_k%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20V%20%2B%20o_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_h%20%2B%3D%20tl.load(p_h0%2C%20mask%3Dmask_h%2C%20other%3D0).to(tl.float32)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E9%80%90%20Token%20%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%20%C2%B7%201%2F5%20%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%E5%AF%84%E5%AD%98%E5%99%A8%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Ffused_recurrent.py%23L100-L179%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>加载 Token 与写入系数。</strong> 时间循环逐步加载 Q/K/V，按需归一化 Q/K，并对 query 施加输出缩放。beta 可以按 head 或 value 通道读取，再按配置执行 sigmoid</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-396%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22for%20_%20in%20tl.range(0%2C%20T)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_q%20%3D%20tl.load(p_q%2C%20mask%3Dmask_k%2C%20other%3D0).to(tl.float32)%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_k%20%3D%20tl.load(p_k%2C%20mask%3Dmask_k%2C%20other%3D0).to(tl.float32)%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_v%20%3D%20tl.load(p_v%2C%20mask%3Dmask_v%2C%20other%3D0).to(tl.float32)%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20USE_QK_L2NORM_IN_KERNEL%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_q%20%3D%20b_q%20%2F%20tl.sqrt(tl.sum(b_q%20*%20b_q)%20%2B%201e-6)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_k%20%3D%20b_k%20%2F%20tl.sqrt(tl.sum(b_k%20*%20b_k)%20%2B%201e-6)%5Cn%20%20%20%20b_q%20%3D%20b_q%20*%20scale%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20IS_BETA_HEADWISE%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_beta%20%3D%20tl.load(p_beta).to(tl.float32)%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_beta%20%3D%20tl.load(p_beta%2C%20mask%3Dmask_v%2C%20other%3D0).to(tl.float32)%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20APPLY_BETA_SIGMOID%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_beta%20%3D%20tl.sigmoid(b_beta)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20ALLOW_NEG_EIGVAL%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_beta%20%3D%20b_beta%20*%202%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E9%80%90%20Token%20%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%20%C2%B7%202%2F5%20%E5%8A%A0%E8%BD%BD%20Token%20%E4%B8%8E%E5%86%99%E5%85%A5%E7%B3%BB%E6%95%B0%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Ffused_recurrent.py%23L100-L179%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>衰减历史状态。</strong> scalar gate 对整个状态片段统一衰减；可选的 key/value gate 则分别沿对应维度缩放。融合 gate 分支在这里计算衰减参数</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-397%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20if%20USE_G%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_g%20%3D%20tl.load(p_g).to(tl.float32)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20USE_GATE_IN_KERNEL%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_A%20%3D%20tl.load(A_log%20%2B%20i_hv).to(tl.float32)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20HAS_DT_BIAS%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_g%20%3D%20b_g%20%2B%20tl.load(dt_bias%20%2B%20i_hv).to(tl.float32)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_g%20%3D%20-exp(b_A)%20*%20softplus(b_g)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_h%20*%3D%20exp(b_g)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20USE_GK%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_gk%20%3D%20tl.load(p_gk).to(tl.float32)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20STATE_V_FIRST%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_h%20*%3D%20exp(b_gk%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_h%20*%3D%20exp(b_gk%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20USE_GV%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_gv%20%3D%20tl.load(p_gv).to(tl.float32)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20STATE_V_FIRST%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_h%20*%3D%20exp(b_gv%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_h%20*%3D%20exp(b_gv%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E9%80%90%20Token%20%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%20%C2%B7%203%2F5%20%E8%A1%B0%E5%87%8F%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Ffused_recurrent.py%23L100-L179%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>残差写入与状态读出。</strong> 先减去旧状态在当前 key 上的预测，再用 beta 加权残差并执行外积写入；更新后的状态对 query 读出。输出写回后，所有输入指针推进到下一个 token</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-398%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20if%20STATE_V_FIRST%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_v%20%3D%20b_beta%20*%20(b_v%20-%20tl.sum(b_h%20*%20b_k%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%2C%201))%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_h%20%2B%3D%20b_v%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20b_k%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_o%20%3D%20tl.sum(b_h%20*%20b_q%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%2C%201)%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_v%20%3D%20b_beta%20*%20(b_v%20-%20tl.sum(b_h%20*%20b_k%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%2C%200))%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_h%20%2B%3D%20b_k%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20b_v%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b_o%20%3D%20tl.sum(b_h%20*%20b_q%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%2C%200)%5Cn%20%20%20%20tl.store(p_o%2C%20b_o.to(p_o.dtype.element_ty)%2C%20mask%3Dmask_v)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_q%20%2B%3D%20H%20*%20K%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_k%20%2B%3D%20H%20*%20K%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_v%20%2B%3D%20HV%20*%20V%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20USE_G%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20p_g%20%2B%3D%20HV%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20USE_GK%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20p_gk%20%2B%3D%20HV%20*%20K%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20USE_GV%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20p_gv%20%2B%3D%20HV%20*%20V%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_beta%20%2B%3D%20HV%20*%20(1%20if%20IS_BETA_HEADWISE%20else%20V)%5Cn%20%20%20%20p_o%20%2B%3D%20HV%20*%20V%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E9%80%90%20Token%20%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%20%C2%B7%204%2F5%20%E6%AE%8B%E5%B7%AE%E5%86%99%E5%85%A5%E4%B8%8E%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E8%AF%BB%E5%87%BA%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Ffused_recurrent.py%23L100-L179%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><strong>保存末态。</strong> 时间循环结束后，按选定的状态布局写回寄存器中的末态。<code>mask_h</code> 屏蔽补齐的 K/V 位置，供下一次调用继续使用</li>
</ul>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-399%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22if%20STORE_FINAL_STATE%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20STATE_V_FIRST%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20p_ht%20%3D%20ht%20%2B%20i_nh%20*%20K%20*%20V%20%2B%20o_v%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20K%20%2B%20o_k%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20p_ht%20%3D%20ht%20%2B%20i_nh%20*%20K%20*%20V%20%2B%20o_k%5B%3A%2C%20None%5D%20*%20V%20%2B%20o_v%5BNone%2C%20%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20tl.store(p_ht%2C%20b_h.to(p_ht.dtype.element_ty)%2C%20mask%3Dmask_h)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22codeDetails%22%3A%7B%22caption%22%3A%22%E9%80%90%20Token%20%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%20%C2%B7%205%2F5%20%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E6%9C%AB%E6%80%81%22%2C%22sourceLabel%22%3A%22FLA%20%C2%B7%20%E8%8A%82%E9%80%89%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Ffla-org%2Fflash-linear-attention%2Fblob%2Fv0.5.2%2Ffla%2Fops%2Fgated_delta_rule%2Ffused_recurrent.py%23L100-L179%22%7D%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li>代码在循环前加载初始状态，在循环后写回末态。逐 token 解码时通常只有一次迭代，Q/K/V 指针按各自的 head 数前进，gate 和 beta 则按 value head 前进。状态更新发生在寄存器中，输出与末态分别写回对应缓冲区</li>
<li>该循环由逐元素乘法、外积和归约组成，没有矩阵乘法指令。Chunk 将多个时间步的依赖组织为三角求解与矩阵乘法，以提高整段序列计算的并行度；recurrent 则直接执行单步状态转移。当前 fused recurrent 实现未提供 backward，训练由 chunk 路径完成</li>
<li>在数学上令 chunk 长度为 1，严格下三角系数为零，代码中保存的逆矩阵 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-400%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22A%3DI%22%7D"></card>。此时 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-401%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22u_t%3D%5C%5Cbeta_t%20v_t%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-402%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22w_t%3D%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Calpha_t%20k_t%22%7D"></card>，还需扣除入口状态的预测，才得到 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-403%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22e_t%3Du_t-H_%7Bt-1%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20w_t%22%7D"></card>；随后按同一条递推更新状态并读出。因此 chunk 的末态可以直接作为 recurrent 的初始状态，prefill 与解码之间保持同一个状态递推关系</li>
</ul>
</section>
